bmit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-what-kind-of-problem-it-is","content":"You want information, not a correction"},"45":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-19","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-what-kind-of-problem-it-is","content":"**Other**"},"46":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-20","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-what-kind-of-problem-it-is","content":"None of the above fits"},"47":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-21","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-what-kind-of-problem-it-is","content":"**Issue Type** — how you are reporting it. Choosing from the website, pick\n**Web Form**. The other options (In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal,\nWritten, Mobile App) are used by officers recording a complaint on someone\nelse's behalf."},"48":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-22","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-what-kind-of-problem-it-is","content":"**Next** stays grey until you have picked one of each."},"49":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-23","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-where-it-happened","content":"Choose the area the problem relates to, starting from the top level and\nworking down. Each choice you make reveals the next level, so keep selecting\nuntil there are no more lists to fill."},"50":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-24","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#say-where-it-happened","content":"This is what decides which office receives your complaint, so pick the place\nthe problem actually happened — not where you live, if they are different."},"51":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-25","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#describe-what-happened","content":"Two required fields:"},"52":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-26","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#describe-what-happened","content":"**When did this happen?** — the date of the problem. Today's date is filled\nin already; change it if the problem happened earlier."},"53":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-27","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#describe-what-happened","content":"**Description** — what happened, where, and how it affected you. At least\n10 characters, up to 5,000."},"54":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-28","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#describe-what-happened","content":"Write the description in your own words and include anything that would help\nsomeone find the problem: a place name, a date, a reference number. An officer\nwho has never been to the location will be reading this."},"55":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-29","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Choice"},"56":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-30","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"What happens"},"57":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-31","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**Stay anonymous**"},"58":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-32","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Your complaint is handled without any contact details. Nobody can call you for more information, and you will not be notified when it is resolved."},"59":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-33","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**I want updates**"},"60":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-34","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"You give a phone number or email, and you can be contacted about progress and the outcome."},"61":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-35","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"**Stay anonymous** is selected by default. Either way you still get a tracking\ncode, and you can still check the status yourself at any time."},"62":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-36","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#choose-whether-to-give-your-contact-details","content":"Click **Submit Complaint** to finish."},"63":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-37","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"You are shown a **tracking code** that looks like `RDAP-260907-6503`."},"64":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-38","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"Write this code down or take a photograph of the screen before you close the\npage. If you chose to stay anonymous, this code is the **only** way to check\nyour complaint later — it cannot be recovered or sent to you again."},"65":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-39","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#after-you-submit","content":"Then see Check a complaint."},"66":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-40","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**The Next button stays grey.** A required field on that step is still\nempty. On step 1 you need both a category and an issue type; on step 3 the\ndescription must be at least 10 characters."},"67":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-41","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Your location is not in the list.** Choose the closest area above it and\nname the exact place in the description instead."},"68":{"id":"/docs/citizen/submit-42","page_id":"/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/submit#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**You closed the page mid-way.** Nothing is saved until you press\n**Submit Complaint**, so start again from the beginning."},"69":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"page","content":"Check a complaint","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track"},"70":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-0","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track","content":"Use your tracking code to see the current status. No account or password needed."},"71":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-1","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#type-in-your-tracking-code","content":"Type in your tracking code"},"72":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-2","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#click-track-complaint","content":"Click Track Complaint"},"73":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-3","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-the-statuses-mean","content":"What the statuses mean"},"74":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-4","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#what-you-will-and-will-not-see","content":"What you will and will not see"},"75":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-5","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/citizen/track#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"76":{"id":"/docs/citizen/track-6","page_id":"/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/citizen/track","content":"Open **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal/track**,\nor click **Track** in the top menu."},"77":