wanda screen."},"238":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Welcome","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"239":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"A plain-language guide to the Grievance Redress Mechanism (eGRM) — for the people who report problems and the people who resolve them."},"240":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"Which part do you need?"},"241":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#how-a-complaint-moves","content":"How a complaint moves"},"242":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#it-is-reported","content":"It is reported"},"243":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#it-gets-a-tracking-code","content":"It gets a tracking code"},"244":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#it-is-reviewed-and-assigned","content":"It is reviewed and assigned"},"245":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#it-is-resolved","content":"It is resolved"},"246":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#about-the-language","content":"About the language"},"247":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"eGRM is how a problem gets reported, tracked, and fixed. A member of the\npublic raises a complaint; a government officer records it, routes it to the\nright person, and resolves it. Everyone can see where it stands."},"248":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"This guide assumes no technical background. Pick the description below that\nsounds like you."},"249":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"<Card title=\"I want to report a problem\" description=\"Send a complaint from the public website, with or without giving your name, and check on it later. No account needed.\" href=\"/docs/citizen\" />"},"250":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"<Card title=\"I record complaints from the public\" description=\"Field Officer — take a complaint in person, by phone or by SMS and enter it into the system correctly.\" href=\"/docs/staff/field-officer\" />"},"251":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"<Card title=\"I assign and resolve complaints\" description=\"Reviewer or Supervisor — check new complaints, send them to the right officer, and record the outcome.\" href=\"/docs/staff/reviewer\" />"},"252":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"<Card title=\"I set up and run the system\" description=\"Project Administrator — create a project, load regions, add staff, and decide how complaints are routed.\" href=\"/docs/staff/administrator\" />"},"253":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#which-part-do-you-need","content":"<Card title=\"I work from a phone\" description=\"The mobile app — record complaints in the field, with or without signal, and see the figures for your area.\" href=\"/docs/mobile\" />"},"254":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#how-a-complaint-moves","content":"Every complaint follows the same path, no matter how it arrives:"},"255":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#it-is-reported","content":"Someone submits it on the public website, or tells a field officer in person,\nby phone, by SMS, or through the mobile app. The officer records it for them."},"256":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#it-gets-a-tracking-code","content":"The system gives the complaint a code like `RDAP-260907-6503`. Anyone holding\nthat code can check the status without logging in."},"257":{"id":"/docs-18","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#it-is-reviewed-and-assigned","content":"A reviewer confirms the details and sends it to the officer or department\nresponsible for that area."},"258":{"id":"/docs-19","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#it-is-resolved","content":"The assigned officer investigates, records what was done, and closes it. The\nstatus visible to the public updates at the same time."},"259":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#about-the-language","content":"The system opens in **Kinyarwanda**. The public website also offers\n**English** and **Français**, and you can switch at any time using the\nselector in the top-right corner."},"260":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#about-the-language","content":"The public website screenshots in this guide show the **English** version, so\nthey match the English text around them. The staff screens are shown in\n**Kinyarwanda**, because that is what staff accounts on this system actually\ndisplay. Every staff label is also listed in English on the\nScreen labels page."},"261":{"id":"/docs/mobile","page_id":"/docs/mobile","type":"page","content":"The mobile app","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile"},"262":{"id":"/docs/mobile-0","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile","content":"What the eGRM phone app is for, how to sign in, and what the four buttons on the home screen do."},"263":{"id":"/docs/mobile-1","page_id":"/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"What you can do with it"},"264":{"id":"/docs/mobile-2","page_id":"/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile#open-the-app","content":"Open the app"},"265":{"id":"/docs/mobile-3","page_id":"/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile#sign-in","content":"Sign in"},"266":{"id":"/docs/mobile-4","page_id":"/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"The home screen"},"267":{"id":"/docs/mobile-5","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile","content":"Field officers do most of their work away from a desk — at a community\nmeeting, at a site visit, in a village with no reliable signal. The eGRM\nmobile app is the same system as the website, sized for a phone, and it keeps\nworking when the network does not."},"268":{"id":"/docs/mobile-6","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile","content":"The app is for **staff**, not for the public. Members of the public report\nproblems on the website at\n**egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** — see\nFor the public. You need a staff account to get past the\nsign-in screen."},"269":{"id":"/docs/mobile-7","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"**Record a complaint** a citizen brings to you, through a six-step\nconversation designed to be read aloud."},"270":{"id":"/docs/mobile-8","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"**See the complaints assigned to you**, and what stage each one is at."},"271":{"id":"/docs/mobile-9","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"**See the figures** for your area — how many complaints, how many resolved,\nhow long they take."},"272":{"id":"/docs/mobile-10","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#what-you-can-do-with-it","content":"Assigning and resolving are possible from the app too, but they are easier on\nthe website. This guide covers recording and viewing."},"273":{"id":"/docs/mobile-11","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#open-the-app","content":"The first screen asks whether you have used the app before, and lets you pick\nyour language."},"274":{"id":"/docs/mobile-12","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#open-the-app","content":"Choose **YES** if you already have an account — which you do, if an\nadministrator created one for you. Your language choice here applies to the\nwhole app, and you can change it later from **Profile**."},"275":{"id":"/docs/mobile-13","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#sign-in","content":"Enter the same **email address and password** you use on the website. If you\nhave never signed in anywhere, ask your administrator for them."},"276":{"id":"/docs/mobile-14","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#sign-in","content":"The app needs a working internet connection **the first time you sign in**,\nand again whenever you want to send in what you have collected. It does not\nneed one in between — see Working without signal."},"277":{"id":"/docs/mobile-15","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"Four cards, in the order you will normally use them:"},"278":{"id":"/docs/mobile-16","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"Card"},"279":{"id":"/docs/mobile-17","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"What it does"},"280":{"id":"/docs/mobile-18","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"**Collect Reports from Citizens**"},"281":{"id":"/docs/mobile-19","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"Record a new complaint — step by step"},"282":{"id":"/docs/mobile-20","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"**Search Reports**"},"283":{"id":"/docs/mobile-21","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"The complaints assigned to you, grouped by stage"},"284":{"id":"/docs/mobile-22","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"**Sync Files**"},"285":{"id":"/docs/mobile-23","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"Send what you have collected and pull down anything new"},"286":{"id":"/docs/mobile-24","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"**View Reports**"},"287":{"id":"/docs/mobile-25","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"Totals and trends for your area"},"288":{"id":"/docs/mobile-26","page_id":"/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile#the-home-screen","content":"At the bottom are three tabs — **Dashboard**, **Notifications** and\n**Profile**. Profile shows your name, your email, the regions you cover, and\na **Change Password** link."},"289":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"page","content":"Recording a complaint","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record"},"290":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-0","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record","content":"The six-step Citizen Input flow — what to ask at each step, and what to hand back at the end."},"291":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-1","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#before-you-start-pick-the-project","content":"Before you start: pick the project"},"292":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-2","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"How should we contact them?"},"293":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-3","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"Who is reporting?"},"294":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-4","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"What happened?"},"295":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-5","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"Where did it happen?"},"296":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-6","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#read-it-back","content":"Read it back"},"297":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-7","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#give-them-the-code","content":"Give them the code"},"298":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-8","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"Ask before you save"},"299":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-9","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record","content":"Tap **Collect Reports from Citizens** on the home screen. What follows is a\nsix-step conversation. Each step shows you, in grey, the words to say to the\nperson in front of you — you can read them aloud as they are written."},"300":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-10","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record","content":"Nothing is sent anywhere until you finish **Step 5**. You can work through\nall six steps with no signal at all; the complaint is stored on the phone and\ngoes up the next time you are connected."},"301":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-11","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#before-you-start-pick-the-project","content":"Choose the project the complaint belongs to. If you only work on one project\nit is already selected. Then tap **NEXT**."},"302":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-12","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"Three choices:"},"303":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-13","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"Choice"},"304":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-14","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"Use it when"},"305":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-15","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"**Do not receive updates**"},"306":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-16","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"They want nothing sent to them at all"},"307":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-17","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"**Receive updates from facilitator**"},"308":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-18","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"They will come back to you for news — the safest default"},"309":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-19","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"**Receive alerts directly**"},"310":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-20","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"They want an SMS or email, and will give you the number or address"},"311":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-21","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#how-should-we-contact-them","content":"If you are unsure, leave it on **Receive updates from facilitator** and make\nsure they leave with their tracking code."},"312":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-22","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"The name is **optional**. Say so out loud — the screen tells you to. If they\nwould rather not be named, leave it blank and move on; the complaint is\nrecorded exactly the same way."},"313":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-23","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"Three tick-boxes below it matter:"},"314":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-24","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"**Keep name confidential** — the name is stored but only the officer\nresolving the complaint can see it."},"315":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-25","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"**Filing on behalf of someone else** — an individual, or an organisation."},"316":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-26","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#who-is-reporting","content":"Age group, gender, occupation and education are all optional. They are used\nfor reporting on who the mechanism actually reaches, so fill them in if the\nperson is comfortable answering — and skip them if not."},"317":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-27","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"This is the step that decides whether the complaint can be resolved."},"318":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-28","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"**The date** — when the problem happened, not today. Tap **Set for Today**\nonly if it is happening now. Tick **Current event or multiple occurrences**\nfor something ongoing."},"319":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-29","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"**How it reached you** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal or\nWritten. Choose the channel the person actually used, not the device you\nare typing on."},"320":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-30","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"**What kind of issue** — Complaint, Service Issue, Question or Other."},"321":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-31","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"**The description** — in the person's own words, as fully as you can. A\nreviewer who was not there has only this to work from."},"322":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-32","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#what-happened","content":"You can attach a **photo**, pick an existing **image**, or record **audio**\nusing the three buttons below the description. Attachments upload when the\nphone next has signal."},"323":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-33","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"Two ways to set the place:"},"324":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-34","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"**Get GPS Location** — use this when you are standing at the spot."},"325":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-35","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"**Tap on the map** — use this when the person is describing somewhere else.\nTap, and drag the pin to adjust."},"326":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-36","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"Either way the app shows the coordinates it captured and where they came\nfrom."},"327":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-37","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"Scroll down and the app names the **region** the complaint will be filed\nunder. If you only cover one region it is chosen for you and says so."},"328":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-38","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"Underneath, add anything that helps someone find the place — a street corner,\na facility name, a landmark. A district name on its own is rarely enough."},"329":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-39","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#where-did-it-happen","content":"The region decides **who receives the complaint**. If the place the person\ndescribes is not in a region you cover, record it anyway, name the exact\nplace in the description, and tell your administrator afterwards."},"330":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-40","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#read-it-back","content":"The app shows everything you entered on one screen. Read the description back\nto the person and check the date. Anything wrong — go back with the arrow at\nthe top-left and fix it."},"331":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-41","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#read-it-back","content":"Then tap **SUBMIT**."},"332":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-42","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#give-them-the-code","content":"The app produces a tracking code like `RDAP-260926-4369`."},"333":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-43","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#give-them-the-code","content":"Read the code back to the person and make sure they have written it down\nbefore they leave. If they chose not to give contact details, this code is\nthe only way they will ever be able to check their complaint again."},"334":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-44","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#give-them-the-code","content":"Tell them they can check it at **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** under\n**Track**, or by coming back to you with the code."},"335":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-45","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#give-them-the-code","content":"Tap **Back to Citizen Input Home** to record the next one."},"336":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-46","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"The quality of a complaint is decided entirely in this conversation. Before\nStep 5, check you have:"},"337":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-47","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"**Where exactly** — a village, facility or landmark, not just a district."},"338":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-48","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"**When exactly** — a date, even an approximate one."},"339":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-49","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"**What specifically went wrong**, in their words rather than a summary like\n\"service problem\"."},"340":{"id":"/docs/mobile/record-50","page_id":"/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/record#ask-before-you-save","content":"**Whether they want to be contacted**, and a number if they do."},"341":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"page","content":"Seeing your work","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports"},"342":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-0","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports","content":"The complaints assigned to you, the figures for your area, and how syncing works when you have no signal."},"343":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-1","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"The complaints assigned to you"},"344":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-2","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"Opening one complaint"},"345":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-3","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#calling-the-person-back","content":"Calling the person back"},"346":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-4","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"The figures for your area"},"347":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-5","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"Working without signal"},"348":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-6","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/mobile/reports#if-sync-fails","content":"If sync fails"},"349":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-7","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Tap **Search Reports** on the home screen. It opens **Summary of Your Work**."},"350":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-8","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Three tabs across the top, with a count on each:"},"351":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-9","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Tab"},"352":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-10","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"What is in it"},"353":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-11","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"**Open**"},"354":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-12","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Recorded, not yet resolved"},"355":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-13","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"**Assigned**"},"356":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-14","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Everything that has been routed to you"},"357":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-15","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"**Resolved**"},"358":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-16","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Closed, with an outcome recorded"},"359":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-17","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"Each row shows how the complaint arrived, its tracking code, the first line\nof the description, who reported it, the date, how long ago, its status, and\nthe region."},"360":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-18","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-complaints-assigned-to-you","content":"The newest is at the top — so a complaint you have just recorded appears\nfirst, with **0 days ago** against it."},"361":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-19","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"Tap any row."},"362":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-20","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"Three tabs:"},"363":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-21","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"**ACTIONS** — what you can do next."},"364":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-22","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"**DETAILS** — everything that was recorded about it."},"365":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-23","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"**HISTORY** — every step anyone has taken on it, with names and dates."},"366":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-24","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"The actions run in order, and only the next one is available. A complaint\nthat has just arrived offers **Accept Issue** and nothing else; once accepted\nit offers **Record Steps Taken**, then **Record Resolution**, then\n**Rate & Appeal**. **Escalate** sends it up to a supervisor when it cannot be\nsettled at your level."},"367":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-25","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#opening-one-complaint","content":"A greyed-out button is not broken — it is a step that comes later. Work down\nthe list in order."},"368":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-26","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#calling-the-person-back","content":"If the person left a phone or WhatsApp number when they reported, a **call**\nor **WhatsApp** button sits next to their name at the top of this screen. Tap\nit to reach them without copying the number out by hand."},"369":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-27","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#calling-the-person-back","content":"The button is absent when no number was given, and when the person asked for\ntheir name to be kept confidential — in that case the screen shows\n**Confidential** and withholds the contact details along with the name."},"370":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-28","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Tap **View Reports** on the home screen."},"371":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-29","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Four numbers at the top:"},"372":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-30","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Card"},"373":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-31","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"What it counts"},"374":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-32","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**Total Issues**"},"375":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-33","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Everything you can see, with this month's share below it"},"376":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-34","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**This Week**"},"377":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-35","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Recorded in the current week"},"378":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-36","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**Resolved**"},"379":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-37","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Closed with an outcome, and the resolution rate"},"380":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-38","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**Average Resolution**"},"381":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-39","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"How many days a complaint takes, on average"},"382":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-40","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Each card also compares against the period before it, so you can see whether\nthe direction is up or down."},"383":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-41","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"Scroll down for the trends."},"384":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-42","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**Category Trends** — Complaint, Service Issue, Question, Other."},"385":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-43","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"**Type Trends** — the channel complaints arrived through: Mobile App, In\nPerson, Email, Web Form, SMS, Phone Call."},"386":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-44","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#the-figures-for-your-area","content":"These are the figures used to decide which channels the public actually rely\non, which is why getting the channel right at\nStep 3 matters."},"387":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-45","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"The app keeps a copy of your work on the phone. You can record complaints all\nday with no network and lose nothing."},"388":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-46","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"Tap **Sync Files** to see where things stand."},"389":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-47","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"**Everything synchronized** with a green dot, and the time of the last\nsync, means the phone and the server agree."},"390":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-48","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"**Check for Updates** sends anything waiting and pulls down anything new.\nDo this whenever you get back into signal."},"391":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-49","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"**Download all my data again** rebuilds the phone's copy from scratch. Use\nit only if complaints or projects you expect are missing."},"392":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-50","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#working-without-signal","content":"A complaint you recorded in the field is **not visible to anyone else** until\nthe phone has synced. Before you finish for the day, open **Sync Files** and\ncheck that it says *Everything synchronized*."},"393":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-51","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#if-sync-fails","content":"You may see *Background sync failed* while you are out of coverage. That on\nits own is not a problem — nothing is lost. Get back into signal, open\n**Sync Files**, and tap **Check for Updates**."},"394":{"id":"/docs/mobile/reports-52","page_id":"/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/mobile/reports#if-sync-fails","content":"If it still fails with a good connection, sign out from **Profile** and sign\nin again. If that does not clear it, report it to your administrator with the\ntime it happened."},"395":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"page","content":"Project Administrator","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator"},"396":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-0","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator","content":"Creating a project, loading its regions, adding staff, and deciding how complaints are routed."},"397":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-1","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-1--name-the-project","content":"Step 1 — Name the project"},"398":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-2","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-2--build-the-region-structure","content":"Step 2 — Build the region structure"},"399":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-3","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Steps 3 to 8 — Define the vocabulary"},"400":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-4","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-9--add-the-staff","content":"Step 9 — Add the staff"},"401":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-5","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-10-to-12--routing-time-limits-and-statuses","content":"Steps 10 to 12 — Routing, time limits and statuses"},"402":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-6","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-13--activate","content":"Step 13 — Activate"},"403":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-7","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Before you hand it over"},"404":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-8","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/administrator#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"405":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-9","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator","content":"A project is the container for everything else — its regions, its categories,\nits staff, and its complaints. Setting one up is done through the **Project\nSetup Wizard**, which walks through the steps in order and saves as it goes."},"406":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-10","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator","content":"From the main screen, open **Imishinga → Tangiriza Umushinga Mushya**\n(*Projects → Start New Project*). To change a project that already exists,\nopen it and choose **Edit in Wizard**."},"407":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-11","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-1--name-the-project","content":"The title, an optional start and end date, and the locale — country, default\nlanguage, number and date format, time zone."},"408":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-12","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-1--name-the-project","content":"**Default Language** here sets the labels that both citizens and staff see.\nChoose it deliberately: changing it later changes the interface for everyone\non the project at once."},"409":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-13","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-2--build-the-region-structure","content":"This is the most important step in the whole setup, and the hardest to change\nafterwards."},"410":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-14","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-2--build-the-region-structure","content":"First define the **levels** — the tiers your administrative hierarchy has,\nsuch as Province, District, Sector, Cell."},"411":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-15","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-2--build-the-region-structure","content":"Then load the actual regions into those levels. They can be imported rather\nthan typed one by one."},"412":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-16","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-2--build-the-region-structure","content":"Every complaint is routed by its region, and every officer sees complaints\nbased on the region they are assigned to. If the structure is wrong or\nincomplete, complaints will reach the wrong office and officers will be unable\nto see work that belongs to them. Get this right before adding anyone."},"413":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-17","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"These steps set the lists people will choose from. Each is a simple table you\nadd rows to."},"414":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-18","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Step"},"415":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-19","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"What it defines"},"416":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-20","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"User types"},"417":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-21","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"The kinds of staff account the project has"},"418":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-22","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Departments"},"419":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-23","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"The units that complaints can be assigned to"},"420":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-24","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Categories"},"421":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"What a complaint can be about"},"422":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Issue types"},"423":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"The channels complaints arrive through"},"424":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Citizen groups"},"425":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"How complainants are grouped for reporting"},"426":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Notification templates"},"427":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-31","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"The wording of the messages the system sends"},"428":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-32","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-3-to-8--define-the-vocabulary","content":"Keep these lists short. A category list with thirty entries produces\ninconsistent filing, because two officers will classify the same complaint\ndifferently."},"429":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-33","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-9--add-the-staff","content":"Users can be added one at a time, or loaded in bulk from a file."},"430":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-34","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-9--add-the-staff","content":"For a bulk load, upload the file, map its columns to the fields eGRM expects,\ncheck the preview, and confirm."},"431":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-35","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-9--add-the-staff","content":"**An account by itself grants nothing.** What determines which complaints a\nperson can see is the **region they are assigned to** — not their role. Staff\nin this system typically hold the same set of duties as each other and differ\nonly by region. A new user with no region assignment signs in successfully and\nsees an empty system."},"432":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-36","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-9--add-the-staff","content":"Check the preview before confirming a bulk import. Correcting a bad import is\nconsiderably more work than reading the preview."},"433":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-37","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-10-to-12--routing-time-limits-and-statuses","content":"**Routing** decides which department or role receives a complaint, based on\nits category and region."},"434":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-38","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-10-to-12--routing-time-limits-and-statuses","content":"**Time limits** set how long each stage may take before a complaint escalates\non its own."},"435":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-39","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-10-to-12--routing-time-limits-and-statuses","content":"**Statuses** are the stages a complaint passes through. Some are marked as\n*final*, meaning the complaint is finished."},"436":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-40","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#steps-10-to-12--routing-time-limits-and-statuses","content":"Be careful with **final** statuses. Marking more than one status as final —\nfor example both *Resolved* and *Closed* — makes the end state of a complaint\nambiguous, and which one a resolved complaint lands in may not be the one you\nintended. Keep exactly one final status unless you have a firm reason\notherwise, and check the result on a test complaint afterwards."},"437":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-41","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#step-13--activate","content":"Activation opens the project for real complaints."},"438":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-42","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Check each of these yourself rather than assuming:"},"439":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-43","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Submit a test complaint through the public website and confirm it appears\nfor the officer who should receive it."},"440":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-44","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Sign in as one ordinary staff account and confirm they see the complaints\nthey should — and not the ones they should not."},"441":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-45","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Check the tracking page returns a sensible result for the test complaint's\ncode."},"442":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-46","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#before-you-hand-it-over","content":"Delete the test complaint before real use begins."},"443":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-47","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**A user sees nothing after signing in.** They have no region assignment.\nThis is the most common report by a wide margin."},"444":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-48","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Complaints reach the wrong office.** Check the region structure first and\nthe routing rules second — a misplaced region explains most of these."},"445":{"id":"/docs/staff/administrator-49","page_id":"/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/administrator#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**A region is missing.** Add it at the right level; do not attach it to the\nwrong parent as a shortcut, because visibility for every officer above it\nfollows that parent."},"446":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"page","content":"Field Officer","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer"},"447":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-0","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer","content":"Recording a complaint that someone brings to you in person, by phone, by SMS or on paper."},"448":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-1","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Record a complaint"},"449":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-2","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#give-the-person-their-tracking-code","content":"Give the person their tracking code"},"450":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-3","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"Ask before you write"},"451":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-4","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Checking on what you have recorded"},"452":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-5","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"453":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-6","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer","content":"Most complaints do not arrive through the website. Someone stops you at a\nmeeting, calls the office, or sends an SMS. Your job is to get that into the\nsystem accurately, so it reaches the right officer and the person can follow\nit up."},"454":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-7","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Away from a desk? The same complaint can be recorded on the\nmobile app, which works with no signal and syncs when\nyou get back into coverage."},"455":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-8","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"From the sidebar, click **Andika Ikibazo** (*Record Issue*)."},"456":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-9","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Fill in the form:"},"457":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-10","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Field (Kinyarwanda)"},"458":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-11","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"English"},"459":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-12","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"What to put"},"460":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-13","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Umushinga"},"461":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-14","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Project"},"462":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-15","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"The project this belongs to"},"463":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-16","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Icyiciro"},"464":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-17","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Category"},"465":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-18","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Complaint, Service Issue, Question or Other"},"466":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-19","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Ubwoko bw'Ikibazo"},"467":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-20","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Issue Type"},"468":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-21","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"**How it reached you** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal, Written"},"469":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-22","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Itariki y'Ikibazo"},"470":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-23","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Issue Date"},"471":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-24","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"When the problem happened"},"472":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Itariki yo Kwakira"},"473":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Intake Date"},"474":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"When it reached you"},"475":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Ibisobanuro"},"476":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Description"},"477":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"What happened, in as much detail as you have"},"478":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-31","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Akarere"},"479":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-32","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Region"},"480":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-33","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Where the problem happened"},"481":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-34","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"**Issue Type** records the channel the complaint arrived through, not how\nserious it is. If someone telephoned you, choose **Phone Call** — not\n**Web Form**, even though you are typing it into a web page. These figures are\nused to decide which channels the public actually rely on."},"482":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-35","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#record-a-complaint","content":"Then save."},"483":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-36","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#give-the-person-their-tracking-code","content":"Saving produces a tracking code like `RDAP-260907-6503`."},"484":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-37","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#give-the-person-their-tracking-code","content":"Read this code back to the person, and make sure they have written it down,\nbefore they leave or you end the call. If they gave no contact details, this\ncode is the only way they can ever check their complaint again."},"485":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-38","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#give-the-person-their-tracking-code","content":"Tell them they can check it at **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** under\n**Track**, and that it will show the status but not their description."},"486":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-39","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"The quality of a complaint depends almost entirely on what you capture at this\nmoment. Before you save, check you have:"},"487":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-40","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**Where exactly.** A village or facility name, not just a district. This is\nwhat decides who receives it."},"488":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-41","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**When exactly.** A date, even an approximate one."},"489":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-42","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**What specifically went wrong**, in the person's own words rather than a\nsummary like \"service problem\"."},"490":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-43","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**Whether they want to be contacted.** If they do, take a phone number. If\nthey would rather not be named, that is their right — record it anonymously\nand say so."},"491":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-44","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"**Ibibazo Bifunguye** (*Open Issues*) in the sidebar lists complaints that are\nstill active."},"492":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-45","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"The coloured pill in the **Imimerere** (*Status*) column shows where each one\nhas got to:"},"493":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-46","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Pill"},"494":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-47","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"English"},"495":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-48","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Meaning"},"496":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-49","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Gishya"},"497":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-50","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"New"},"498":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-51","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Recorded, not yet reviewed"},"499":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-52","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Birakorwa"},"500":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-53","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"In Progress"},"501":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-54","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Assigned, being worked on"},"502":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-55","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Byakemuwe"},"503":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-56","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Resolved"},"504":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-57","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"An outcome has been recorded"},"505":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-58","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"You will only see complaints for the regions you are assigned to."},"506":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-59","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**The region you need is not in the list.** Choose the nearest level above\nit and name the exact place in the description. Then tell your administrator\nthe region is missing."},"507":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-60","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**You saved it with the wrong details.** Open the complaint and use\n**Reassign Issue** for the wrong owner, or ask a reviewer for anything else\n— once submitted, some fields are locked to keep the record trustworthy."},"508":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-61","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Someone reports the same problem twice.** Record it anyway and mention the\nearlier tracking code in the description. A reviewer will merge them."},"509":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"page","content":"Reviewer and Supervisor","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer"},"510":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-0","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer","content":"Checking new complaints, sending them to the right officer, recording the outcome, and handling escalations."},"511":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-1","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Find what needs your attention"},"512":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-2","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Open a complaint"},"513":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-3","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Assign it to someone"},"514":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-4","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"Record the outcome"},"515":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-5","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"Escalations and appeals"},"516":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-6","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#what-you-can-and-cannot-see","content":"What you can and cannot see"},"517":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-7","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"518":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-8","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer","content":"You are the point where a complaint stops being a piece of text and becomes\nsomeone's assigned work. Two things depend on you: that it reaches the right\nofficer, and that what happened is written down."},"519":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-9","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Three places in the sidebar:"},"520":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-10","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"521":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-11","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"English"},"522":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-12","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"What is in it"},"523":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-13","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"524":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-14","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Open Issues"},"525":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-15","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Everything still active in your regions"},"526":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-16","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Iby'integuro Byanjye"},"527":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-17","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"My Assignments"},"528":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-18","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Complaints assigned to you personally"},"529":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-19","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"530":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-20","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Record Issue"},"531":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-21","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"Enter a new complaint yourself"},"532":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-22","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#find-what-needs-your-attention","content":"The list shows the tracking code, the status pill, and the reference. The grey\nboxes along the top filter it — by project, category, department, assignee,\nissue type, status or region. Newly arrived complaints carry the\n**Gishya** (*New*) pill."},"533":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-23","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Click any row."},"534":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-24","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"The tabs across the top separate the record into sections:"},"535":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"536":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"English"},"537":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Holds"},"538":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"},"539":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Issue Details"},"540":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"The complaint itself — dates, category, description, region, status"},"541":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-31","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Amakuru y'Umuturage"},"542":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-32","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Citizen Information"},"543":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-33","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Contact details, if any were given"},"544":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-34","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Inyandiko z'ibikorwa by'ikibazo"},"545":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-35","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Issue Activity Log"},"546":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-36","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Every action taken, in order"},"547":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-37","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Gukurikirana Ibibazo"},"548":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-38","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Issue Tracking"},"549":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-39","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Progress against the complaint"},"550":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-40","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Iyinjizwa"},"551":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-41","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Escalation"},"552":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-42","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Escalation history, if it was escalated"},"553":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-43","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"**Citizen Information may be empty, and that is deliberate.** People are\nallowed to report anonymously. An empty contact tab is not a data problem and\nis not something to chase — it means nobody may be called about this\ncomplaint, and the outcome has to be published through the tracking code\ninstead."},"554":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-44","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Use **Assign** in the right-hand panel to add an officer, or **Reassign\nIssue** at the top of the page to move it to a different one."},"555":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-45","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Before you assign, check two things:"},"556":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-46","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"**Is the region right?** Routing follows the region on the complaint. If it\nis wrong, the complaint sits with an office that cannot act on it."},"557":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-47","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"**Is the category right?** A \"Question\" misfiled as a \"Complaint\" enters a\nresolution process it never needed."},"558":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-48","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Both are quicker to correct now than after the work has been handed on."},"559":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-49","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"When the assigned officer has finished, the outcome is recorded against the\ncomplaint and the status moves on."},"560":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-50","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"Recording the outcome moves the complaint to **Resolved** and stores your name\nagainst it as the resolver. That status is the one the public sees on the\ntracking page, so the person checking their code is told as soon as you save —\nthere is no separate step to publish it."},"561":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-51","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"Write the outcome so that it makes sense to someone who was not involved: what\nwas found, what was done, and when. This text is the record of the decision."},"562":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-52","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"Two cards on the main screen cover work that did not finish normally:"},"563":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-53","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"**Igenzura → Ibyitwajwe** (*Supervision → Escalated*) — complaints raised to\na higher level, usually because they passed their time limit or needed\nauthority the assigned officer did not have."},"564":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-54","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"**Igitekerezo → Ubujurire** (*Feedback → Appeals*) — where someone has come\nback dissatisfied with the outcome."},"565":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-55","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"Check both regularly. Neither will come to you as a notification if you are\nnot assigned to the individual complaint."},"566":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-56","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#what-you-can-and-cannot-see","content":"You see complaints for the regions you are assigned to, **including the\nregions beneath them**. A supervisor assigned at province level sees the\ndistricts within it; an officer assigned to one district sees only that one."},"567":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-57","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#what-you-can-and-cannot-see","content":"If a complaint you expect is missing, the usual cause is a region assignment,\nnot a permission setting — check with your administrator."},"568":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-58","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**A complaint is in the wrong region.** Correct the region, then reassign.\nChanging the assignee alone leaves the routing wrong for next time."},"569":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-59","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Nobody is available in the assigned department.** Reassign to another\nofficer rather than leaving it unassigned — an unassigned complaint has no\nowner and will not be picked up by anyone."},"570":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-60","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**The same problem is reported twice.** Resolve one and record the other's\ntracking code in the outcome, so both codes give the person a real answer."},"571":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"page","content":"Signing in","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in"},"572":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-0","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"How to reach your work area, and what the main screen is showing you."},"573":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-1","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"Sign in"},"574":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-2","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"The main screen"},"575":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-3","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Which role am I?"},"576":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-4","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"577":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-5","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"Staff work in a different part of the system from the public website. You need\nan account, which an administrator creates for you."},"578":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-6","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"Go to **egrm.risa.gov.rw/login** and enter\nthe email address and password you were given."},"579":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-7","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"After signing in you land on the **eGRM** work area."},"580":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-8","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Two parts matter:"},"581":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-9","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"**The sidebar on the left** is always there. Its entries are:"},"582":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-10","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"583":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-11","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"English"},"584":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-12","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Shakisha"},"585":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-13","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Search"},"586":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-14","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Imenyekanisha"},"587":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-15","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Notifications"},"588":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-16","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Ahabanza"},"589":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-17","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Home"},"590":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-18","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"591":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-19","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Record Issue"},"592":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-20","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"593":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-21","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Open Issues"},"594":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-22","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Iby'integuro Byanjye"},"595":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-23","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"My Assignments"},"596":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-24","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"**The cards in the middle** group everything else by the kind of work it\nbelongs to — intake, feedback, supervision, projects, users, and system\nsettings. You will only be able to open the ones your role allows."},"597":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Your name and email are shown at the bottom-left. Click there to sign out."},"598":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"The staff screens display in **Kinyarwanda**, because that is the language\nthis system is set to. The Screen labels page lists every\nlabel you will meet with its English meaning. If you would rather work in\nEnglish, ask your administrator to set the language on your own account — it\nchanges only what you see, not what anyone else sees."},"599":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Roles in eGRM are about **duties**, and most staff hold several at once. What\nactually differs between two officers is usually the **region** they are\nassigned to, not the buttons they can press."},"600":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"If your job is…"},"601":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Read"},"602":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Taking complaints from the public and entering them"},"603":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-31","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Field Officer"},"604":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-32","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Checking new complaints and sending them to the right person"},"605":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-33","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Reviewer and Supervisor"},"606":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-34","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Setting up projects, regions and staff accounts"},"607":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-35","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Project Administrator"},"608":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-36","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Your password does not work.** Passwords are not shown to anyone, so a\nreset is the only fix — ask your administrator."},"609":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-37","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**You sign in but see almost nothing.** You have an account but no region\nassignment yet. Until an administrator assigns you to a region, there are no\ncomplaints you are allowed to see."},"610":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-38","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**A complaint you expect is missing.** You only see complaints for the\nregions you are assigned to. If it belongs to a neighbouring district, it\nwill not appear for you."},"611":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","type":"page","content":"Gukoresha urubuga rusange","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen"},"612":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen","content":"Ibyo urubuga rusange rugufasha gukora, n'uko waruhindura ururimi rwawe."},"613":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Ibintu bibiri ushobora gukora"},"614":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"Guhindura ururimi"},"615":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen#icyo-mobile-app-iri-muri-menu-ikora","content":"Icyo \"Mobile App\" iri muri menu ikora"},"616":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibikurikira","content":"Ibikurikira"},"617":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen","content":"**Ntukeneye** konti, ijambobanga, cyangwa porogaramu ya telefoni kugira ngo\nutange ikibazo. Ibiri kuri iyi paji byose bikorera kuri mushakisha iyo ari yo\nyose."},"618":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen","content":"Fungura **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal**."},"619":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Nshaka…"},"620":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Aho ukanda"},"621":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Gutanga ikibazo gishya"},"622":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"**Submit a Complaint → Start form**"},"623":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Kureba ikibazo namaze gutanga"},"624":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"**Track a Complaint → Enter code**"},"625":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibintu-bibiri-ushobora-gukora","content":"Utwo tubuto twombi turi ku ipaji y'itangiriro, kandi turi no muri menu iri\nhejuru kuri buri paji."},"626":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"Urubuga rufungurwa mu Kinyarwanda. Kugira ngo urusome mu rundi rurimi,\nkoresha agasanduku kari mu **mfuruka yo hejuru iburyo** ku ipaji iyo ari yo\nyose. Hari amahitamo atatu:"},"627":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"**Kinyarwanda** (urw'ibanze)"},"628":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"**Icyongereza**"},"629":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"**Igifaransa**"},"630":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"Icyo wahisemo gihita gikora, kandi kiguma uko wimuka hagati y'amapaji."},"631":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#guhindura-ururimi","content":"Guhindura ururimi bihindura inyandiko n'utubuto gusa. Nta kintu na kimwe\nbihindura ku kibazo cyawe, kandi ushobora gusubira ku rundi rurimi igihe icyo\nari cyo cyose."},"632":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#icyo-mobile-app-iri-muri-menu-ikora","content":"Ihuza rya **Mobile App** ni iry'abakozi bo ku rwego rw'ibanze bakusanya\nibibazo ahantu hatari murandasi. Nk'umuturage ntuyikeneye — urubuga rukora\nibyo ukeneye byose."},"633":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibikurikira","content":"<Card title=\"Ohereza ikibazo\" description=\"Ifishi y'intambwe enye. Bifata iminota mike.\" href=\"/rw/docs/citizen/submit\" />"},"634":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen#ibikurikira","content":"<Card title=\"Kureba aho ikibazo kigeze\" description=\"Koresha kode yawe yo gukurikirana urebe aho kigeze.\" href=\"/rw/docs/citizen/track\" />"},"635":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","type":"page","content":"Ohereza ikibazo","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit"},"636":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","content":"Ifishi y'intambwe enye iri ku rubuga rusange. Ushobora kuyohereza utatanze amazina yawe."},"637