n/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Category** (icyiciro) — icyo ikibazo cyawe kivuga:"},"647":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Ihitamo"},"648":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Ukoreshe iyo"},"649":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Complaint**"},"650":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Hari ikitagenze neza kandi ushaka ko gikosorwa"},"651":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Service Issue**"},"652":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Serivisi itagenda, itinze, cyangwa itaboneka"},"653":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Question**"},"654":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Ushaka amakuru, atari igikosorwa"},"655":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Other**"},"656":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"Nta na kimwe mu byavuzwe haruguru gihuye"},"657":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Issue Type** (ubwoko) — uburyo uri kugitanga. Iyo ugitangiye ku rubuga,\nhitamo **Web Form**. Andi mahitamo (In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal,\nWritten, Mobile App) akoreshwa n'abakozi bandika ikibazo mu izina ry'undi\nmuntu."},"658":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-ubwoko-bwikibazo","content":"**Next** iguma ifite ibara ry'ivu kugeza wahisemo rimwe muri buri kiciro."},"659":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-aho-byabereye","content":"Hitamo agace ikibazo kirebana na ko, utangirira ku rwego rwo hejuru ugana\nhasi. Buri hitamo rigaragaza urwego rukurikira, bityo komeza guhitamo kugeza\nnta rutonde rusigaye."},"660":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#vuga-aho-byabereye","content":"Ari byo bigena ibiro bizakira ikibazo cyawe, bityo hitamo ahantu ikibazo\ncyabereye koko — atari aho utuye, niba bitandukanye."},"661":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#sobanura-ibyabaye","content":"Ibice bibiri bisabwa:"},"662":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#sobanura-ibyabaye","content":"**When did this happen?** — itariki ikibazo cyabereyeho. Itariki y'uyu munsi\nisanzwe yanditsemo; uyihindure niba ikibazo cyarabaye mbere."},"663":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#sobanura-ibyabaye","content":"**Description** — ibyabaye, aho byabereye, n'uko byakugizeho ingaruka.\nNibura inyuguti 10, kugeza ku 5.000."},"664":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#sobanura-ibyabaye","content":"Andika ibisobanuro mu magambo yawe bwite kandi ushyiremo ibintu byose byafasha\numuntu kubona ikibazo: izina ry'ahantu, itariki, nimero y'ibaruwa. Umukozi\nutigeze ajya aho byabereye ni we uzabisoma."},"665":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"Ihitamo"},"666":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"Icyo bivuze"},"667":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"**Stay anonymous**"},"668":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"Ikibazo cyawe gikemurwa nta makuru yo kukugeraho. Nta muntu ushobora kuguhamagara ngo akubaze byinshi, kandi ntuzamenyeshwa igihe kizakemuka."},"669":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"**I want updates**"},"670":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"Utanga nimero ya telefoni cyangwa imeyili, bityo bashobora kukugezaho aho bigeze n'icyemezo cyafashwe."},"671":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"**Stay anonymous** ni yo isanzwe ihiswemo. Uko byagenda kose uhabwa kode yo\ngukurikirana, kandi ushobora ubwawe kureba aho kigeze igihe icyo ari cyo cyose."},"672":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#hitamo-niba-utanga-aho-bakugeraho","content":"Kanda **Submit Complaint** kugira ngo urangize."},"673":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#nyuma-yo-kohereza","content":"Werekwa **kode yo gukurikirana** isa na `RDAP-260907-6503`."},"674":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#nyuma-yo-kohereza","content":"Andika iyi kode cyangwa ufate ifoto y'icyapa mbere yo gufunga ipaji. Niba\nwarahisemo kutamenyekana, iyi kode ni yo **nzira yonyine** yo kureba ikibazo\ncyawe nyuma — ntishobora kongera kuboneka cyangwa kukoherezwa ukundi."},"675":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#nyuma-yo-kohereza","content":"Hanyuma reba Kureba aho ikibazo kigeze."},"676":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Akabuto ka Next kaguma gafite ibara ry'ivu.** Hari icyanzu gisabwa kuri\niyo ntambwe kitarujujwe. Ku ntambwe ya 1 usabwa icyiciro n'ubwoko\nbw'ikibazo; ku ntambwe ya 3 ibisobanuro bigomba kuba bifite nibura inyuguti\n10\\."},"677":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Ahantu wari ushaka ntihari ku rutonde.** Hitamo agace kegereye kari\nharuguru yaho, hanyuma wandike ahantu nyirizina mu bisobanuro."},"678":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/submit#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Wafunze ipaji utararangiza.** Nta kintu kibikwa kugeza ukanze\n**Submit Complaint**, bityo ugomba gutangira bundi bushya."},"679":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"page","content":"Kureba aho ikibazo kigeze","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track"},"680":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","content":"Koresha kode yawe yo gukurikirana urebe aho kigeze. Nta konti cyangwa ijambobanga bikenewe."},"681":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#andika-kode-yawe-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Andika kode yawe yo gukurikirana"},"682":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#kanda-track-complaint","content":"Kanda Track Complaint"},"683":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Icyo imimerere isobanura"},"684":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#ibyo-uzabona-nibyo-utazabona","content":"Ibyo uzabona n'ibyo utazabona"},"685":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"Niba wabuze aho uhera"},"686":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","content":"Fungura **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal/track**,\ncyangwa ukande **Track** muri menu yo hejuru."},"687":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#andika-kode-yawe-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Iyi ni kode wahawe igihe wohereza ikibazo, isa na `RDAP-260907-6503`. Yandike\nuko iri neza, ushyiremo n'udusongo."},"688":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#kanda-track-complaint","content":"Werekwa imimerere ikibazo kigezemo, icyiciro cyacyo, n'itariki wagitangiyeho."},"689":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Imimerere"},"690":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Icyo bivuze kuri wowe"},"691":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"**New** (Gishya)"},"692":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Cyakiriwe, gitegereje umukozi uzagisuzuma."},"693":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"**In Progress** (Kiri gukorwaho)"},"694":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Cyahawe umukozi uri kugikoraho."},"695":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"**Resolved** (Cyakemuwe)"},"696":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Umukozi yanditse icyemezo cyafashwe."},"697":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"**Closed** (Cyafunzwe)"},"698":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Cyarangiye kandi cyabitswe."},"699":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"**Rejected** (Cyanzwe)"},"700":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#icyo-imimerere-isobanura","content":"Ntigikomeje — akenshi kubera ko kitari mu byo ubu buryo bukemura, cyangwa nta makuru ahagije yo kugikoraho."},"701":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#ibyo-uzabona-nibyo-utazabona","content":"Ipaji yo gukurikirana yerekana gusa imimerere, icyiciro n'itariki cyatangiweho\n— ibyo ni ibyagambiriwe. Ntiyerekana ibisobanuro wanditse, amakuru yo\nkukugeraho, cyangwa amazina y'abakozi babikoraho. Ibi bituma kode yo\ngukurikirana, yaba isangiwe cyangwa yumviwe n'undi muntu, itamugaragariza\namakuru yawe bwite."},"702":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**\"Not found\" cyangwa nta gisubizo.** Genzura kode inyuguti ku yindi —\ninyuguti ni kode y'umushinga naho imibare ikubiyemo itariki. Biroroshye\ngusoma `0` nk'aho ari `O`."},"703":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Wabuze kode.** Niba warahaye amakuru yo kukugeraho igihe wohereza,\nibiro bishobora kugushakira ikibazo cyawe. Niba warahisemo kutamenyekana,\nnta bundi buryo bwo kuyibona — wagomba kongera gutanga ikibazo."},"704":{"id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/citizen/track","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/citizen/track#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Imimerere imaze igihe kirekire itahindutse.** Vugana n'ibiro bishinzwe\numushinga, ubahe kode yawe yo gukurikirana."},"705":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"page","content":"Inyandiko ziri ku byapa","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary"},"706":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary","content":"Buri nyandiko y'Ikinyarwanda iri ku byapa by'abakozi, n'icyo isobanura mu Cyongereza."},"707":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Kugenda muri sisitemu"},"708":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#ibice-byicyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Ibice by'icyapa nyamukuru"},"709":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#ibyanzu-biri-ku-kibazo","content":"Ibyanzu biri ku kibazo"},"710":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#amatabi-ari-ku-kibazo","content":"Amatabi ari ku kibazo"},"711":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#imimerere","content":"Imimerere"},"712":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/glossary#utubuto","content":"Utubuto"},"713":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary","content":"Ibyapa by'abakozi muri iyi sisitemu byerekanwa mu Kinyarwanda. Iyi paji\nihuza inyandiko iri ku cyapa cyawe n'iy'Icyongereza, kugira ngo ubashe\ngusobanukirwa inyandiko z'Icyongereza uhura na zo muri sisitemu cyangwa mu\nzindi nyandiko."},"714":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Ku cyapa"},"715":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Mu Cyongereza"},"716":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Ahabanza"},"717":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Home"},"718":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Shakisha"},"719":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Search"},"720":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Imenyekanisha"},"721":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Notifications"},"722":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"723":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Record Issue"},"724":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"725":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/glossary#kugenda-muri-sisitemu","content":"Open Issues"},"726":{"id":"/rw/docs/glossary-20","page_id":"/rw