:"/rw/docs","content":"Imfashanyigisho yoroshye ya eGRM (Uburyo bwo Gukemura Ibibazo) — ku bantu batanga ibibazo n'abantu babikemura."},"850":{"id":"/rw/docs-1","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"Ni ikihe gice ukeneye?"},"851":{"id":"/rw/docs-2","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#uko-ikibazo-kinyura","content":"Uko ikibazo kinyura"},"852":{"id":"/rw/docs-3","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#giratangwa","content":"Giratangwa"},"853":{"id":"/rw/docs-4","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#gihabwa-kode-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Gihabwa kode yo gukurikirana"},"854":{"id":"/rw/docs-5","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#kirasuzumwa-kandi-kigahabwa-uwagikemura","content":"Kirasuzumwa kandi kigahabwa uwagikemura"},"855":{"id":"/rw/docs-6","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#kirakemuka","content":"Kirakemuka"},"856":{"id":"/rw/docs-7","page_id":"/rw/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs#ku-bijyanye-nururimi","content":"Ku bijyanye n'ururimi"},"857":{"id":"/rw/docs-8","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs","content":"eGRM ni uburyo ikibazo gitangwamo, gikurikiranwa kandi gikemurwa. Umuturage\natanga ikibazo; umukozi wa Leta akikwandika, akikohereza ku muntu ubikwiye,\nmaze akagikemura. Buri wese ashobora kureba aho kigeze."},"858":{"id":"/rw/docs-9","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs","content":"Iyi mfashanyigisho ntikeneye ubumenyi bw'ikoranabuhanga. Hitamo ibisobanuro\nbiri hepfo bihuye n'akazi ukora."},"859":{"id":"/rw/docs-10","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"<Card title=\"Nshaka gutanga ikibazo\" description=\"Ohereza ikibazo ukoresheje urubuga rusange, waba utanze amazina yawe cyangwa utayatanze, hanyuma ukurikirane aho kigeze. Nta konti ukeneye.\" href=\"/rw/docs/citizen\" />"},"860":{"id":"/rw/docs-11","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"<Card title=\"Nakira ibibazo by'abaturage\" description=\"Umukozi wo ku rwego rw'ibanze — akira ikibazo imbonankubone, kuri telefoni cyangwa kuri SMS, hanyuma ukinjize muri sisitemu neza.\" href=\"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer\" />"},"861":{"id":"/rw/docs-12","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"<Card title=\"Ngena uwakemura ikibazo kandi nkandika icyemezo\" description=\"Umugenzuzi — genzura ibibazo bishya, ubyohereze ku mukozi ubikwiye, wandike icyemezo cyafashwe.\" href=\"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer\" />"},"862":{"id":"/rw/docs-13","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"<Card title=\"Nshyiraho kandi nyobora sisitemu\" description=\"Umuyobozi w'umushinga — fungura umushinga, winjizemo uturere, wongeremo abakozi, uhitemo uko ibibazo byoherezwa.\" href=\"/rw/docs/staff/administrator\" />"},"863":{"id":"/rw/docs-14","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ni-ikihe-gice-ukeneye","content":"<Card title=\"Nkorera kuri telefoni\" description=\"Porogaramu ya telefoni — andika ibibazo uri mu kazi, waba ufite murandasi cyangwa utayifite, kandi urebe imibare y'aho ukorera.\" href=\"/rw/docs/mobile\" />"},"864":{"id":"/rw/docs-15","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#uko-ikibazo-kinyura","content":"Buri kibazo kinyura mu nzira imwe, uko cyaba cyaje kose:"},"865":{"id":"/rw/docs-16","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#giratangwa","content":"Umuntu akiyandikisha ku rubuga rusange, cyangwa akabwira umukozi wo ku rwego\nrw'ibanze imbonankubone, kuri telefoni, kuri SMS, cyangwa binyuze muri\nporogaramu ya telefoni. Umukozi akikwandikira."},"866":{"id":"/rw/docs-17","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#gihabwa-kode-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Sisitemu iha ikibazo kode nka `RDAP-260907-6503`. Umuntu wese ufite iyo kode\nashobora kureba aho kigeze atabanje kwinjira muri sisitemu."},"867":{"id":"/rw/docs-18","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#kirasuzumwa-kandi-kigahabwa-uwagikemura","content":"Umugenzuzi yemeza ko amakuru ari ukuri, hanyuma akakohereza ku mukozi cyangwa\nishami rishinzwe ako gace."},"868":{"id":"/rw/docs-19","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#kirakemuka","content":"Umukozi wagihawe aragikurikirana, akandika ibyakozwe, hanyuma akagifunga.\nImimerere abaturage babona ihita ihinduka icyarimwe."},"869":{"id":"/rw/docs-20","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ku-bijyanye-nururimi","content":"Sisitemu ifungurwa mu **Kinyarwanda**. Urubuga rusange na rwo rutanga\n**Icyongereza** n'**Igifaransa**, kandi ushobora guhindura igihe icyo ari cyo\ncyose ukoresheje agasanduku kari mu mfuruka yo hejuru iburyo."},"870":{"id":"/rw/docs-21","page_id":"/rw/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs#ku-bijyanye-nururimi","content":"Amafoto y'urubuga rusange ari muri iyi mfashanyigisho yerekana uburyo bwo mu\n**Cyongereza**. Amafoto y'ibyapa by'abakozi yerekanwa mu **Kinyarwanda**, kuko\nari cyo konti z'abakozi muri sisitemu zerekana. Buri nyandiko iri ku byapa\nby'abakozi iranasobanurwa mu Cyongereza ku ipaji\nInyandiko ziri ku byapa."},"871":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","type":"page","content":"Porogaramu ya telefoni","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile"},"872":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile","content":"Icyo porogaramu ya eGRM yo kuri telefoni ikora, uko winjiramo, n'icyo utubuto tune turi ku cyapa cy'itangiriro dukora."},"873":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile#ibyo-ushobora-gukora-na-yo","content":"Ibyo ushobora gukora na yo"},"874":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile#fungura-porogaramu","content":"Fungura porogaramu"},"875":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile#injira","content":"Injira"},"876":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Icyapa cy'itangiriro"},"877":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile","content":"Abakozi bo ku rwego rw'ibanze akazi kabo kenshi bagakorera kure y'ameza —\nmu nama y'abaturage, mu rugendo rwo gusura ahakorerwa, mu mudugudu udafite\nmurandasi ihamye. Porogaramu ya eGRM yo kuri telefoni ni sisitemu imwe\nn'urubuga, yagenewe telefoni, kandi ikomeza gukora n'ubwo murandasi yaba\nitariho."},"878":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile","content":"Porogaramu igenewe **abakozi**, ntigenewe abaturage. Abaturage batanga\nibibazo ku rubuga rwa\n**egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** — reba\nKu baturage. Ukeneye konti y'umukozi kugira ngo urenge\nicyapa cyo kwinjira."},"879":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#ibyo-ushobora-gukora-na-yo","content":"**Kwandika ikibazo** umuturage akuzaniye, unyuze mu kiganiro cy'intambwe\nesheshatu cyanditswe kugira ngo gisomerwe mu ijwi riranguruye."},"880":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#ibyo-ushobora-gukora-na-yo","content":"**Kureba ibibazo waherewe**, n'intambwe buri kimwe kigezemo."},"881":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#ibyo-ushobora-gukora-na-yo","content":"**Kureba imibare** y'aho ukorera — ibibazo bingahe, ibyakemutse bingahe,\nn'igihe bimara."},"882":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#ibyo-ushobora-gukora-na-yo","content":"Kugena uwakemura ikibazo no gukemura birashoboka na byo kuri porogaramu,\nariko biroroshye ku rubuga. Iyi mfashanyigisho ivuga ku kwandika no kureba."},"883":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#fungura-porogaramu","content":"Icyapa cya mbere kibaza niba warigeze gukoresha porogaramu, kandi kikaguha\nguhitamo ururimi."},"884":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#fungura-porogaramu","content":"Hitamo **YES** niba usanzwe ufite konti — ni ko biri, niba umuyobozi wa\nsisitemu yaragushyiriyeho konti. Ururimi uhisemo aha rukoreshwa muri\nporogaramu yose, kandi ushobora kuruhindura nyuma uhereye kuri **Profile**."},"885":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#injira","content":"Andika **aderesi y'imeyili n'ijambobanga** bimwe ukoresha ku rubuga. Niba\nutarigeze winjira ahandi na hamwe, bisabe umuyobozi wa sisitemu."},"886":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#injira","content":"Porogaramu ikeneye murandasi ikora **ubwa mbere winjiye**, no mu gihe cyose\nushaka kohereza ibyo wakusanyije. Ntiyibikeneye hagati aho — reba\nGukora nta murandasi."},"887":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Amakarita ane, mu bwuzuzanye uzajya uyakoreshamo:"},"888":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Ikarita"},"889":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Icyo ikora"},"890":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"**Collect Reports from Citizens**"},"891":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Andika ikibazo gishya — intambwe ku yindi"},"892":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"**Search Reports**"},"893":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Ibibazo waherewe, bishyizwe mu matsinda hakurikijwe intambwe"},"894":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"**Sync Files**"},"895":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Ohereza ibyo wakusanyije kandi ukure ibishya"},"896":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"**View Reports**"},"897":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Imibare rusange n'icyerekezo cy'aho ukorera"},"898":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile#icyapa-cyitangiriro","content":"Hasi hari amatabi atatu — **Dashboard**, **Notifications** na **Profile**.\nProfile yerekana izina ryawe, imeyili yawe, uturere ukoreramo, n'ihuza rya\n**Change Password**."},"899":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"page","content":"Kwandika ikibazo","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record"},"900":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","content":"Inzira ya Citizen Input y'intambwe esheshatu — icyo ubaza kuri buri ntambwe, n'icyo usubiza nyir'ikibazo ku iherezo."},"901":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#mbere-yo-gutangira-hitamo-umushinga","content":"Mbere yo gutangira: hitamo umushinga"},"902":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Twabageraho dute?"},"903":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"Ni nde uri gutanga ikibazo?"},"904":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"Ni iki cyabaye?"},"905":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Byabereye he?"},"906":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#musomere-ibyanditswe","content":"Musomere ibyanditswe"},"907":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#muhe-kode","content":"Muhe kode"},"908":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"Baza mbere yo kubika"},"909":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","content":"Kanda **Collect Reports from Citizens** ku cyapa cy'itangiriro. Ibikurikiraho\nni ikiganiro cy'intambwe esheshatu. Buri ntambwe ikwereka, mu ibara ry'ivu,\namagambo yo kubwira umuntu uri imbere yawe — ushobora kuyasoma mu ijwi\nriranguruye uko yanditse."},"910":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","content":"Nta kintu cyoherezwa ahandi kugeza urangije **Intambwe ya 5**. Ushobora\nkunyura mu ntambwe zose esheshatu nta murandasi na mba; ikibazo kibikwa kuri\ntelefoni kikoherezwa ubutaha uzaba ufite uburyo bwo guhuza."},"911":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#mbere-yo-gutangira-hitamo-umushinga","content":"Hitamo umushinga ikibazo kirebana na wo. Niba ukorera umushinga umwe gusa,\nusanzwe wahiswemo. Hanyuma ukande **NEXT**."},"912":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Amahitamo atatu:"},"913":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Ihitamo"},"914":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Rikoreshe iyo"},"915":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"**Do not receive updates**"},"916":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Badashaka ko haba ikintu cyoherezwa kuri bo na gato"},"917":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"**Receive updates from facilitator**"},"918":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Bazagaruka kuri wowe kugira ngo bamenye amakuru — ni ryo rifite umutekano kurusha ayandi"},"919":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"**Receive alerts directly**"},"920":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Bashaka SMS cyangwa imeyili, kandi bazatanga nimero cyangwa aderesi"},"921":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#twabageraho-dute","content":"Niba udashidikanya, siga kuri **Receive updates from facilitator** kandi\numenye neza ko bagenda bafite kode yabo yo gukurikirana."},"922":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"Izina **ntirisabwa**. Bivuge mu ijwi riranguruye — icyapa kirabikubwira. Niba\nbadashaka ko amazina yabo amenyekana, siga umwanya ubusa ukomeze; ikibazo\ncyandikwa kimwe."},"923":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"Udusanduku dutatu turi hepfo ni ngombwa:"},"924":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"**Hisha amazina** — izina ribikwa ariko ni umukozi ugiye gukemura ikibazo\nwenyine ushobora kuribona."},"925":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"**Ndi gutanga ikibazo mu izina ry'undi** — umuntu ku giti cye, cyangwa\numuryango."},"926":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-nde-uri-gutanga-ikibazo","content":"Itsinda ry'imyaka, igitsina, umwuga n'amashuri byose ntibisabwa. Bikoreshwa\nmu gukora raporo y'abantu ubu buryo bugeraho koko, bityo ubyuzuze niba\nnyir'ikibazo yumva ashobora kubisubiza — kandi ubisimbuke niba atabishaka."},"927":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"Iyi ni yo ntambwe igena niba ikibazo gishobora gukemuka."},"928":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"**Itariki** — igihe ikibazo cyabereye, atari uyu munsi. Kanda\n**Set for Today** gusa niba kiri kubaho ubu. Shyira akamenyetso kuri\n**Current event or multiple occurrences** ku kintu gikomeje."},"929":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"**Uko cyakugezeho** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal cyangwa\nWritten. Hitamo inzira nyir'ikibazo yanyuzemo koko, atari igikoresho uri\nkwandikiraho."},"930":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"**Ubwoko bw'ikibazo** — Complaint, Service Issue, Question cyangwa Other."},"931":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"**Ibisobanuro** — mu magambo ya nyir'ikibazo, mu buryo burambuye uko\nushoboye. Umugenzuzi utari aho ni ibi gusa azaba afite."},"932":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#ni-iki-cyabaye","content":"Ushobora gufatanya **ifoto**, guhitamo **ishusho** isanzweho, cyangwa gufata\n**amajwi** ukoresheje utubuto dutatu turi hepfo y'ibisobanuro. Ibifatanyijwe\nbyoherezwa igihe telefoni yongeye kubona murandasi."},"933":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Hari uburyo bubiri bwo gushyiraho ahantu:"},"934":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"**Get GPS Location** — bukoreshwe iyo uhagaze ahantu nyirizina."},"935":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"**Kanda ku ikarita** — bukoreshwe iyo nyir'ikibazo avuga ahandi hantu.\nKanda, hanyuma ukurure akamenyetso ukosore."},"936":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Uko byagenda kose porogaramu yerekana ibipimo yafashe n'aho byaturutse."},"937":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Manuka hepfo maze porogaramu ikwereke **akarere** ikibazo kizandikwamo. Niba\nukorera akarere kamwe gusa, kahiswemo kandi kirabikubwira."},"938":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Hepfo yaho, wongereho ikintu cyose cyafasha umuntu kubona aho hantu — isoko\nry'inzira, izina ry'ikigo, ikimenyetso. Izina ry'akarere ryonyine akenshi\nntirihagije."},"939":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#byabereye-he","content":"Akarere ni ko kagena **uwakira ikibazo**. Niba ahantu nyir'ikibazo avuga\nhatari mu turere ukorera, kandika ikibazo uko biri, wandike ahantu nyirizina\nmu bisobanuro, hanyuma ubibwire umuyobozi wa sisitemu nyuma."},"940":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#musomere-ibyanditswe","content":"Porogaramu yerekana ibyo winjije byose ku cyapa kimwe. Somera nyir'ikibazo\nibisobanuro kandi ugenzure itariki. Icyo ari cyo cyose kitari cyo — subira\ninyuma ukoresheje akambi kari hejuru ibumoso ugikosore."},"941":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#musomere-ibyanditswe","content":"Hanyuma ukande **SUBMIT**."},"942":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#muhe-kode","content":"Porogaramu itanga kode yo gukurikirana nka `RDAP-260926-4369`."},"943":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-43","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#muhe-kode","content":"Somera nyir'ikibazo iyo kode kandi umenye neza ko yayanditse mbere yuko\nagenda. Niba atahisemo gutanga amakuru yo kumugeraho, iyi kode ni yo nzira\nyonyine azashobora kongera kurebeshaho ikibazo cye."},"944":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-44","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#muhe-kode","content":"Mubwire ko ashobora kukireba kuri **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** munsi ya\n**Track**, cyangwa agarutse kuri wowe afite kode."},"945":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-45","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#muhe-kode","content":"Kanda **Back to Citizen Input Home** kugira ngo wandike ikindi."},"946":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-46","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"Ubwiza bw'ikibazo bugenwa n'iki kiganiro gusa. Mbere y'Intambwe ya 5,\ngenzura ko ufite:"},"947":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-47","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"**Ahantu nyirizina** — umudugudu, ikigo cyangwa ikimenyetso, atari akarere\ngusa."},"948":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-48","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"**Igihe nyirizina** — itariki, n'iyo yaba iri hafi gusa."},"949":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-49","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"**Icyagenze nabi ku buryo busobanutse**, mu magambo ya nyir'ikibazo aho\nkwandika incamake nka \"ikibazo cya serivisi\"."},"950":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record-50","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/record","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/record#baza-mbere-yo-kubika","content":"**Niba ashaka ko bamuvugisha**, na nimero niba abishaka."},"951":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"page","content":"Kureba akazi kawe","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports"},"952":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","content":"Ibibazo waherewe, imibare y'aho ukorera, n'uko guhuza amakuru bikorwa iyo udafite murandasi."},"953":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Ibibazo waherewe"},"954":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"Gufungura ikibazo kimwe"},"955":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#guhamagara-nyirikibazo","content":"Guhamagara nyir'ikibazo"},"956":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Imibare y'aho ukorera"},"957":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"Gukora nta murandasi"},"958":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#niba-guhuza-amakuru-byanze","content":"Niba guhuza amakuru byanze"},"959":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Kanda **Search Reports** ku cyapa cy'itangiriro. Bifungura **Summary of Your\nWork**."},"960":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Amatabi atatu ari hejuru, buri rimwe rifite umubare:"},"961":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Itabi"},"962":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Ibirimo"},"963":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"**Open**"},"964":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Byanditswe, bitarakemuka"},"965":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"**Assigned**"},"966":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Ibyoherejwe kuri wowe byose"},"967":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"**Resolved**"},"968":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Byafunzwe, hamwe n'icyemezo cyanditswe"},"969":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Buri murongo werekana uko ikibazo cyaje, kode yacyo yo gukurikirana, umurongo\nwa mbere w'ibisobanuro, uwagitanze, itariki, igihe kimaze, imimerere yacyo,\nn'akarere."},"970":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#ibibazo-waherewe","content":"Igishya kiri hejuru — bityo ikibazo umaze kwandika kiza imbere, kifite\n**0 days ago**."},"971":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"Kanda ku murongo uwo ari wo wose."},"972":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"Amatabi atatu:"},"973":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"**ACTIONS** — ibyo ushobora gukora bikurikira."},"974":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"**DETAILS** — ibyanditswe byose kuri cyo."},"975":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"**HISTORY** — buri ntambwe umuntu yakoze kuri cyo, hamwe n'amazina\nn'amatariki."},"976":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"Ibikorwa bikurikirana ku murongo, kandi ni igikurikira cyonyine kiboneka.\nIkibazo kiherutse kugera gitanga **Accept Issue** gusa; iyo kimaze kwemerwa gitanga\n**Record Steps Taken**, hanyuma **Record Resolution**, hanyuma **Rate &\nAppeal**. **Escalate** kigishyikiriza umugenzuzi iyo kidashobora gukemukira ku\nrwego rwawe."},"977":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gufungura-ikibazo-kimwe","content":"Akabuto gafite ibara ry'ivu ntikaba kangiritse — ni intambwe iza nyuma. Kora\nukurikije urutonde."},"978":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#guhamagara-nyirikibazo","content":"Niba nyir'ikibazo yaratanze nimero ya telefoni cyangwa iya WhatsApp igihe\natanga ikibazo, akabuto ko **guhamagara** cyangwa aka **WhatsApp** kaba kari\niruhande rw'izina rye hejuru kuri iki cyapa. Kakande umugereho utagombye\nkwandukura nimero n'intoki."},"979":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#guhamagara-nyirikibazo","content":"Ako kabuto ntikaboneka iyo nta nimero yatanzwe, kandi iyo nyir'ikibazo yasabye\nko amazina ye aba ibanga — muri icyo gihe icyapa cyerekana **Confidential**\nkandi kigafunga amakuru yo kumugeraho hamwe n'amazina."},"980":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Kanda **View Reports** ku cyapa cy'itangiriro."},"981":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Imibare ine iri hejuru:"},"982":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Ikarita"},"983":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Icyo ibara"},"984":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**Total Issues**"},"985":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Ibyo ushobora kubona byose, hamwe n'umugabane w'uku kwezi hepfo yabyo"},"986":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**This Week**"},"987":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Ibyanditswe muri iki cyumweru"},"988":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**Resolved**"},"989":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Ibyafunzwe bifite icyemezo, n'ijanisha ry'ibyakemutse"},"990":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**Average Resolution**"},"991":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Iminsi ikibazo kimara impuzandengo"},"992":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Buri karita inagereranya n'igihe cyabanje, kugira ngo urebe niba ibintu\nbyiyongera cyangwa bigabanuka."},"993":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Manuka hepfo urebe icyerekezo."},"994":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**Category Trends** — Complaint, Service Issue, Question, Other."},"995":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-43","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"**Type Trends** — inzira ibibazo byanyuzemo: Mobile App, In Person, Email,\nWeb Form, SMS, Phone Call."},"996":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-44","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#imibare-yaho-ukorera","content":"Iyi ni yo mibare ikoreshwa mu kumenya inzira abaturage bakoresha koko, ni yo\nmpamvu guhitamo neza inzira ku\nntambwe ya 3 ari ingenzi."},"997":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-45","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"Porogaramu ibika kopi y'akazi kawe kuri telefoni. Ushobora kwandika ibibazo\numunsi wose nta murandasi kandi ntacyo ubura."},"998":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-46","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"Kanda **Sync Files** urebe aho ibintu bigeze."},"999":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-47","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"**Everything synchronized** ifite akadomo k'icyatsi, hamwe n'isaha yo\nguhuza amakuru bwa nyuma, bivuga ko telefoni na seriveri bihuje."},"1000":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-48","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"**Check for Updates** yohereza ibitegereje kandi ikazana ibishya. Bikore\nburi gihe wongeye kubona murandasi."},"1001":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-49","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"**Download all my data again** yubaka bundi bushya kopi iri kuri telefoni.\nUyikoreshe gusa igihe ibibazo cyangwa imishinga wari witeze bibuze."},"1002":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-50","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#gukora-nta-murandasi","content":"Ikibazo wanditse uri mu kazi **nta wundi muntu ukibona** kugeza telefoni\nihuje amakuru. Mbere yo kurangiza umunsi, fungura **Sync Files** hanyuma\nugenzure ko handitse *Everything synchronized*."},"1003":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-51","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#niba-guhuza-amakuru-byanze","content":"Ushobora kubona *Background sync failed* mu gihe uri ahatari murandasi. Ibyo\nbyonyine si ikibazo — nta cyo ubura. Subira aho murandasi iboneka, ufungure\n**Sync Files**, hanyuma ukande **Check for Updates**."},"1004":{"id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports-52","page_id":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/mobile/reports#niba-guhuza-amakuru-byanze","content":"Niba bikomeje kunanirana murandasi ihari, sohoka uhereye kuri **Profile**\nhanyuma wongere winjire. Niba n'ibyo bitagikemuye, bimenyeshe umuyobozi wa\nsisitemu umubwira isaha byabereyeho."},"1005":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"page","content":"Umuyobozi w'umushinga","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator"},"1006":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","content":"Gufungura umushinga, kwinjizamo uturere twawo, kongeramo abakozi, no guhitamo uko ibibazo byoherezwa."},"1007":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-1--ita-umushinga-izina","content":"Intambwe ya 1 — Ita umushinga izina"},"1008":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-2--ubaka-imiterere-yuturere","content":"Intambwe ya 2 — Ubaka imiterere y'uturere"},"1009":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Intambwe ya 3 kugeza ku ya 8 — Shyiraho amagambo akoreshwa"},"1010":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-9--ongeramo-abakozi","content":"Intambwe ya 9 — Ongeramo abakozi"},"1011":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-10-kugeza-ku-ya-12--kohereza-ibihe-ntarengwa-nimimerere","content":"Intambwe ya 10 kugeza ku ya 12 — Kohereza, ibihe ntarengwa n'imimerere"},"1012":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-13--gutangiza","content":"Intambwe ya 13 — Gutangiza"},"1013":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Mbere yo kubishyikiriza abandi"},"1014":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"Niba wabuze aho uhera"},"1015":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","content":"Umushinga ni wo ukubiyemo ibindi byose — uturere twawo, ibyiciro byawo,\nabakozi bawo, n'ibibazo byawo. Kuwushyiraho bikorerwa muri **Project Setup\nWizard**, inyura mu ntambwe ku murongo kandi ikabika uko igenda."},"1016":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","content":"Ku cyapa nyamukuru, fungura **Imishinga → Tangiriza Umushinga Mushya**. Kugira\nngo uhindure umushinga usanzweho, wufungure hanyuma uhitemo **Edit in Wizard**."},"1017":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-1--ita-umushinga-izina","content":"Umutwe, itariki yo gutangira n'iyo kurangiriraho (ntibisabwa), n'ibiranga\nigihugu — igihugu, ururimi rw'ibanze, imiterere y'imibare n'iy'amatariki,\nn'isaha."},"1018":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-1--ita-umushinga-izina","content":"**Default Language** aha ishyiraho inyandiko abaturage n'abakozi bombi babona.\nUyihitemo ubigambiriye: kuyihindura nyuma bihindura icyapa kuri buri wese uri\nku mushinga icyarimwe."},"1019":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-2--ubaka-imiterere-yuturere","content":"Iyi ni yo ntambwe y'ingenzi kurusha izindi mu gushyiraho umushinga, kandi ni\nyo igoye guhindura nyuma."},"1020":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-2--ubaka-imiterere-yuturere","content":"Banza ushyireho **inzego** — ibyiciro ubutegetsi bwawe bufite, urugero nk'\nIntara, Akarere, Umurenge, Akagari."},"1021":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-2--ubaka-imiterere-yuturere","content":"Hanyuma winjize uturere nyirizina muri izo nzego. Dushobora kwinjizwa mu\nburyo bwo kwohereza dosiye aho kudwandika kamwe ku kandi."},"1022":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-2--ubaka-imiterere-yuturere","content":"Buri kibazo cyoherezwa hakurikijwe akarere kacyo, kandi buri mukozi abona\nibibazo hakurikijwe akarere yagenewe. Niba imiterere itari yo cyangwa yuzuye,\nibibazo bizagera ku biro bitari byo kandi abakozi ntibabashe kubona akazi\nkabo. Bikosore neza mbere yo kongeramo umuntu."},"1023":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Izi ntambwe zishyiraho intonde abantu bazahitamo. Buri yose ni imbonerahamwe\nyoroshye wongeramo imirongo."},"1024":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Intambwe"},"1025":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Icyo ishyiraho"},"1026":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"User types"},"1027":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Ubwoko bwa konti z'abakozi umushinga ufite"},"1028":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Departments"},"1029":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Amashami ashobora guhabwa ibibazo"},"1030":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Categories"},"1031":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Ibyo ikibazo gishobora kuvuga"},"1032":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Issue types"},"1033":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Inzira ibibazo binyuramo bigera kuri sisitemu"},"1034":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Citizen groups"},"1035":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Uko abatanze ibibazo bashyirwa mu matsinda mu raporo"},"1036":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Notification templates"},"1037":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Imyandikire y'ubutumwa sisitemu yohereza"},"1038":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-3-kugeza-ku-ya-8--shyiraho-amagambo-akoreshwa","content":"Gumisha izi ntonde ngufi. Urutonde rw'ibyiciro rufite ibintu mirongo itatu\nrutuma ibibazo bitondekanywa mu buryo butandukanye, kuko abakozi babiri\nbazashyira ikibazo kimwe mu byiciro bitandukanye."},"1039":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-9--ongeramo-abakozi","content":"Abakoresha bashobora kongerwamo umwe umwe, cyangwa benshi icyarimwe bavanywe\nmuri dosiye."},"1040":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-9--ongeramo-abakozi","content":"Kugira ngo winjize benshi icyarimwe, ohereza dosiye, uhuze inkingi zayo\nn'ibyanzu eGRM iteze, ugenzure ibyerekanwe, hanyuma wemeze."},"1041":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-9--ongeramo-abakozi","content":"**Konti yonyine nta cyo itanga.** Icyo kigena ibibazo umuntu ashobora kubona\nni **akarere yagenewe** — si inshingano ze. Abakozi muri iyi sisitemu akenshi\nbafite inshingano zimwe, batandukanira ku karere gusa. Umukoresha mushya\nutagenewe akarere yinjira neza ariko akabona sisitemu idafite kirimo."},"1042":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-9--ongeramo-abakozi","content":"Genzura ibyerekanwe mbere yo kwemeza kwinjiza benshi icyarimwe. Gukosora\nibyinjijwe nabi ni akazi kenshi cyane kurusha gusoma ibyerekanwe."},"1043":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-10-kugeza-ku-ya-12--kohereza-ibihe-ntarengwa-nimimerere","content":"**Kohereza** bigena ishami cyangwa inshingano bizakira ikibazo, hakurikijwe\nicyiciro cyacyo n'akarere kacyo."},"1044":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-10-kugeza-ku-ya-12--kohereza-ibihe-ntarengwa-nimimerere","content":"**Ibihe ntarengwa** bigena igihe buri ntambwe ishobora kumara mbere yuko\nikibazo cyitwazwa ubwacyo."},"1045":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-10-kugeza-ku-ya-12--kohereza-ibihe-ntarengwa-nimimerere","content":"**Imimerere** ni intambwe ikibazo kinyuramo. Zimwe zishyirwaho akamenyetso ka\n*final*, bivuze ko ikibazo kirangiye."},"1046":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-10-kugeza-ku-ya-12--kohereza-ibihe-ntarengwa-nimimerere","content":"Witondere imimerere ya **final**. Gushyira akamenyetso ka final ku mimerere\nirenze imwe — urugero *Resolved* na *Closed* byombi — bituma iherezo ry'ikibazo\nritumvikana, kandi aho ikibazo cyakemuwe kigwa bishobora kutaba ari ho\nwagambiriye. Gumisha imimerere imwe gusa ya final keretse ufite impamvu\nifatika, kandi ugenzure ibyavuyemo ukoresheje ikibazo cy'igerageza."},"1047":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#intambwe-ya-13--gutangiza","content":"Gutangiza bifungurira umushinga ibibazo nyakuri."},"1048":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Genzura buri kimwe muri ibi ubwawe aho kubyiyumvisha:"},"1049":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-43","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Ohereza ikibazo cy'igerageza unyuze ku rubuga rusange hanyuma wemeze ko\nkigaragarira umukozi ukwiye kukakira."},"1050":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-44","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Injira ukoresheje konti y'umukozi usanzwe hanyuma wemeze ko abona ibibazo\nakwiye kubona — kandi ko atabona ibyo adakwiye kubona."},"1051":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-45","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Genzura ko ipaji yo gukurikirana itanga igisubizo gifatika kuri kode\ny'ikibazo cy'igerageza."},"1052":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-46","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#mbere-yo-kubishyikiriza-abandi","content":"Siba ikibazo cy'igerageza mbere yuko ikoreshwa nyakuri itangira."},"1053":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-47","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Umukoresha nta cyo abona nyuma yo kwinjira.** Ntaho aragenerwa gukorera.\nIyi ni yo raporo isanzwe cyane kurusha izindi."},"1054":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-48","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Ibibazo bigera ku biro bitari byo.** Banza ugenzure imiterere y'uturere,\nhanyuma ugenzure amategeko yo kohereza — akarere kashyizwe ahatari ho\ngasobanura byinshi muri ibi."},"1055":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator-49","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/administrator#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Hari akarere kabuze.** Kongere ku rwego rukwiye; ntugakomeke ku rwego\nrutari rwo ngo wihutishe, kuko ibyo buri mukozi uri haruguru yako abona\nbikurikiza urwo rwego."},"1056":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"page","content":"Umukozi wo ku rwego rw'ibanze","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer"},"1057":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","content":"Kwandika ikibazo umuntu akuzaniye imbonankubone, kuri telefoni, kuri SMS cyangwa ku rupapuro."},"1058":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Andika ikibazo"},"1059":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#ha-nyirikibazo-kode-ye-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Ha nyir'ikibazo kode ye yo gukurikirana"},"1060":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"Baza mbere yo kwandika"},"1061":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Kureba ibyo wanditse"},"1062":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"Niba wabuze aho uhera"},"1063":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","content":"Ibibazo byinshi ntibinyura ku rubuga. Umuntu aguhagarika mu nama, ahamagara\nibiro, cyangwa yohereza SMS. Akazi kawe ni ukubishyira muri sisitemu uko biri,\nkugira ngo bigere ku mukozi ubikwiye kandi nyir'ikibazo abashe kugikurikirana."},"1064":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Uri kure y'ameza y'akazi? Ikibazo kimwe gishobora kwandikirwa kuri\nporogaramu ya telefoni, ikora nta murandasi kandi\nikohereza amakuru igihe wongeye kubona uburyo bwo guhuza."},"1065":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Ku rutonde ruri ibumoso, kanda **Andika Ikibazo**."},"1066":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Uzuza ifishi:"},"1067":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Icyanzu (Kinyarwanda)"},"1068":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Icyongereza"},"1069":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Icyo ushyiramo"},"1070":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Umushinga"},"1071":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Project"},"1072":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Umushinga ikibazo kirebana na wo"},"1073":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Icyiciro"},"1074":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Category"},"1075":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Complaint, Service Issue, Question cyangwa Other"},"1076":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Ubwoko bw'Ikibazo"},"1077":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Issue Type"},"1078":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"**Uburyo cyakugezeho** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal, Written"},"1079":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Itariki y'Ikibazo"},"1080":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Issue Date"},"1081":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Igihe ikibazo cyabereye"},"1082":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Itariki yo Kwakira"},"1083":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Intake Date"},"1084":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Igihe cyakugezeho"},"1085":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Ibisobanuro"},"1086":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Description"},"1087":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Ibyabaye, mu buryo burambuye uko bishoboka"},"1088":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Akarere"},"1089":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Region"},"1090":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Aho ikibazo cyabereye"},"1091":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"**Ubwoko bw'Ikibazo** bwandika inzira ikibazo cyanyuzemo, atari uburemere\nbwacyo. Niba umuntu yaraguhamagaye, hitamo **Phone Call** — si **Web Form**,\nn'ubwo uri kubyandika ku ipaji ya interineti. Iyi mibare ikoreshwa mu kumenya\ninzira abaturage bakoresha koko."},"1092":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#andika-ikibazo","content":"Hanyuma ubike."},"1093":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#ha-nyirikibazo-kode-ye-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Kubika bitanga kode yo gukurikirana isa na `RDAP-260907-6503`."},"1094":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#ha-nyirikibazo-kode-ye-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Somera nyir'ikibazo iyi kode, kandi umenye neza ko yayanditse, mbere yuko\nagenda cyangwa mbere yuko urangiza guhamagara. Niba atatanze amakuru yo\nkumugeraho, iyi kode ni yo nzira yonyine azashobora kongera kurebeshaho\nikibazo cye."},"1095":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#ha-nyirikibazo-kode-ye-yo-gukurikirana","content":"Mubwire ko ashobora kukireba kuri **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal** munsi ya\n**Track**, kandi ko bizamwereka imimerere ariko ntibyereke ibisobanuro yatanze."},"1096":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"Ubwiza bw'ikibazo buterwa cyane cyane n'ibyo wafashe muri ako kanya. Mbere yo\nkubika, genzura ko ufite:"},"1097":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"**Ahantu nyirizina.** Izina ry'umudugudu cyangwa ry'ikigo, atari akarere\ngusa. Ari byo bigena uwakira ikibazo."},"1098":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"**Itariki nyirizina.** Itariki, n'iyo yaba iri hafi gusa."},"1099":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"**Icyagenze nabi ku buryo busobanutse**, mu magambo ya nyir'ikibazo,\naho kwandika incamake nka \"ikibazo cya serivisi\"."},"1100":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-43","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#baza-mbere-yo-kwandika","content":"**Niba ashaka ko bamuvugisha.** Niba abishaka, fata nimero ya telefoni.\nNiba adashaka ko amazina ye amenyekana, ni uburenganzira bwe — andika\nikibazo nta mazina, kandi umubwire ko ari ko byagenze."},"1101":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-44","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"**Ibibazo Bifunguye** ruri ku rutonde rwo ibumoso rutondekanya ibibazo\nbigikorwaho."},"1102":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-45","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Akato gafite ibara kari mu nkingi ya **Imimerere** kerekana aho buri kibazo\nkigeze:"},"1103":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-46","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Akato"},"1104":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-47","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Icyongereza"},"1105":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-48","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Icyo bisobanura"},"1106":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-49","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Gishya"},"1107":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-50","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"New"},"1108":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-51","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Cyanditswe, ntikirasuzumwa"},"1109":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-52","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Birakorwa"},"1110":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-53","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"In Progress"},"1111":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-54","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Cyarahawe umukozi, kiri gukorwaho"},"1112":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-55","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Byakemuwe"},"1113":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-56","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Resolved"},"1114":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-57","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Icyemezo cyafashwe cyaranditswe"},"1115":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-58","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#kureba-ibyo-wanditse","content":"Uzabona gusa ibibazo by'uturere ugenewe."},"1116":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-59","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Akarere ukeneye ntikari ku rutonde.** Hitamo urwego rwegereye ruri\nharuguru yako, hanyuma wandike ahantu nyirizina mu bisobanuro. Hanyuma\nubwire umuyobozi wa sisitemu ko ako karere kabuze."},"1117":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-60","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Wabitse ufite amakuru atari yo.** Fungura ikibazo ukoreshe\n**Reassign Issue** niba uwagihawe atari we ukwiye, cyangwa usabe umugenzuzi\nikindi cyose — iyo ikibazo kimaze koherezwa, bimwe mu byanzu birafungwa\nkugira ngo inyandiko ikomeze kwizerwa."},"1118":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer-61","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/field-officer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Umuntu atanga ikibazo kimwe kabiri.** Kandika uko biri hanyuma uvuge kode\nyo gukurikirana ya mbere mu bisobanuro. Umugenzuzi azabihuza."},"1119":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"page","content":"Umugenzuzi","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer"},"1120":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","content":"Gusuzuma ibibazo bishya, kubyohereza ku mukozi ubikwiye, kwandika icyemezo cyafashwe, no gukemura ibyitwajwe."},"1121":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Shaka ibigusaba kwitabwaho"},"1122":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Fungura ikibazo"},"1123":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"Ha ikibazo uwakigenzura"},"1124":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#andika-icyemezo-cyafashwe","content":"Andika icyemezo cyafashwe"},"1125":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyitwajwe-nubujurire","content":"Ibyitwajwe n'ubujurire"},"1126":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyo-ushobora-kubona-nibyo-udashobora-kubona","content":"Ibyo ushobora kubona n'ibyo udashobora kubona"},"1127":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"Niba wabuze aho uhera"},"1128":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","content":"Ni wowe utuma ikibazo kireka kuba inyandiko gusa kikaba akazi umuntu yahawe.\nIbintu bibiri biterwa na we: ko ikibazo kigera ku mukozi ubikwiye, kandi ko\nibyabaye byandikwa."},"1129":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Ahantu hatatu ku rutonde rwo ibumoso:"},"1130":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"1131":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Icyongereza"},"1132":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Ibirimo"},"1133":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"1134":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Open Issues"},"1135":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Ibigikorwaho byose mu turere ugenewe"},"1136":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Iby'integuro Byanjye"},"1137":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"My Assignments"},"1138":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Ibibazo waherewe ku giti cyawe"},"1139":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"1140":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Record Issue"},"1141":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Kwandika ikibazo gishya ubwawe"},"1142":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#shaka-ibigusaba-kwitabwaho","content":"Urutonde rwerekana kode yo gukurikirana, akato k'imimerere, n'inomero\ny'ikibazo. Udusanduku tw'ivu turi hejuru dutoranya ibiri ku rutonde — ukurikije\numushinga, icyiciro, ishami, uwagihawe, ubwoko bw'ikibazo, imimerere cyangwa\nakarere. Ibibazo bikigera bifite akato ka **Gishya**."},"1143":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Kanda ku murongo uwo ari wo wose."},"1144":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Amatabi ari hejuru atandukanya inyandiko mu bice:"},"1145":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"1146":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Icyongereza"},"1147":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Ibirimo"},"1148":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"},"1149":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Issue Details"},"1150":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Ikibazo ubwacyo — amatariki, icyiciro, ibisobanuro, akarere, imimerere"},"1151":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Amakuru y'Umuturage"},"1152":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Citizen Information"},"1153":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Amakuru yo kumugeraho, niba yaratanzwe"},"1154":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Inyandiko z'ibikorwa by'ikibazo"},"1155":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-35","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Issue Activity Log"},"1156":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-36","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Buri gikorwa cyakozwe, mu bwuzuzanye"},"1157":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-37","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Gukurikirana Ibibazo"},"1158":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-38","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Issue Tracking"},"1159":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-39","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Aho ikibazo kigeze"},"1160":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-40","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Iyinjizwa"},"1161":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-41","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Escalation"},"1162":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-42","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"Amateka y'ukwitwazwa, niba cyaritwajwe"},"1163":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-43","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#fungura-ikibazo","content":"**Amakuru y'Umuturage ashobora kuba ubusa, kandi ibyo ni byo byagenwe.**\nAbantu bemerewe gutanga ibibazo batamenyekana. Itabi ridafite amakuru yo\nkumugeraho si ikibazo cya sisitemu kandi si ikintu cyo gukurikirana — bivuga\nko nta muntu ushobora guhamagarwa kuri iki kibazo, kandi ko igisubizo kigomba\nkugezwa ku baturage binyuze kuri kode yo gukurikirana."},"1164":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-44","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"Koresha **Assign** iri mu gasanduku ko iburyo kugira ngo wongereho umukozi,\ncyangwa **Reassign Issue** iri hejuru ku ipaji kugira ngo ugihe undi mukozi."},"1165":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-45","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"Mbere yo kugiha umukozi, genzura ibintu bibiri:"},"1166":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-46","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"**Akarere ni ko?** Kohereza ikibazo bikurikiza akarere kariho. Niba atari\nko, ikibazo kiguma ku biro bidashobora kugikoraho."},"1167":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-47","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"**Icyiciro ni cyo?** \"Question\" cyanditswe nka \"Complaint\" cyinjira mu\nnzira yo gukemura itari ikenewe."},"1168":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-48","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ha-ikibazo-uwakigenzura","content":"Byombi biroroshye gukosora ubu kuruta nyuma yuko akazi gahawe undi."},"1169":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-49","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#andika-icyemezo-cyafashwe","content":"Iyo umukozi wagihawe arangije, icyemezo cyafashwe cyandikwa ku kibazo maze\nimimerere igahinduka."},"1170":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-50","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#andika-icyemezo-cyafashwe","content":"Kwandika icyemezo bihindura imimerere y'ikibazo ikaba **Byakemuwe** kandi\nbikandika izina ryawe nk'uwagikemuye. Iyo mimerere ni yo abaturage babona ku\nipaji yo gukurikirana, bityo umuntu ureba kode ye ahita abimenyeshwa igihe\nubitse — nta yindi ntambwe yo kubitangaza ikenewe."},"1171":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-51","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#andika-icyemezo-cyafashwe","content":"Andika icyemezo ku buryo cyumvikana ku muntu utari muri byo: icyabonetse,\nicyakozwe, n'igihe. Iyi nyandiko ni yo nyandiko y'icyemezo cyafashwe."},"1172":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-52","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyitwajwe-nubujurire","content":"Amakarita abiri ari ku cyapa nyamukuru areba akazi katarangiye mu buryo\nbusanzwe:"},"1173":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-53","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyitwajwe-nubujurire","content":"**Igenzura → Ibyitwajwe** (*Supervision → Escalated*) — ibibazo byazamuwe ku\nrwego rwo hejuru, akenshi kubera ko byarenze igihe ntarengwa cyangwa\nbyasabaga ububasha umukozi wabihawe atari afite."},"1174":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-54","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyitwajwe-nubujurire","content":"**Igitekerezo → Ubujurire** (*Feedback → Appeals*) — aho umuntu yagarutse\natanyuzwe n'icyemezo cyafashwe."},"1175":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-55","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyitwajwe-nubujurire","content":"Genzura byombi kenshi. Nta na kimwe kizakugeraho nk'ubutumwa niba utaragenewe\nicyo kibazo ku giti cyawe."},"1176":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-56","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyo-ushobora-kubona-nibyo-udashobora-kubona","content":"Ubona ibibazo by'uturere ugenewe, **hamwe n'uturere turi munsi yatwo**.\nUmugenzuzi ugenewe intara abona uturere turi muri yo; umukozi ugenewe akarere\nkamwe abona ako gusa."},"1177":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-57","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#ibyo-ushobora-kubona-nibyo-udashobora-kubona","content":"Niba ikibazo wari witeze kibuze, impamvu isanzwe ni uko atari ugenewe ako\nkarere, si igenamiterere ry'uburenganzira — banza ubaze umuyobozi wa sisitemu."},"1178":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-58","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Ikibazo kiri mu karere katari ko.** Kosora akarere, hanyuma wongere ugihe\numukozi. Guhindura uwagihawe wenyine bisiga inzira yo kohereza itari yo\nubutaha."},"1179":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-59","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Nta muntu uboneka mu ishami ryagenewe ikibazo.** Kigene undi mukozi aho\nkukireka kidafite uwagihawe — ikibazo kidafite uwagihawe nta nyirakyo\ngifite kandi nta wuzagifata."},"1180":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer-60","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/reviewer#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"**Ikibazo kimwe gitanzwe kabiri.** Kemura kimwe hanyuma wandike kode yo\ngukurikirana y'ikindi mu cyemezo, kugira ngo kode zombi zihe nyir'ikibazo\nigisubizo nyakuri."},"1181":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"page","content":"Kwinjira muri sisitemu","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in"},"1182":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-0","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"Uko ugera ahawe akazi kawe, n'ibyo icyapa nyamukuru kikwereka."},"1183":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-1","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#kwinjira","content":"Kwinjira"},"1184":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-2","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Icyapa nyamukuru"},"1185":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-3","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Ni izihe nshingano mfite?"},"1186":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-4","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#niba-wabuze-aho-uhera","content":"Niba wabuze aho uhera"},"1187":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-5","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"Abakozi bakorera mu gice gitandukanye n'urubuga rusange. Ukeneye konti,\nishyirwaho n'umuyobozi wa sisitemu."},"1188":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-6","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#kwinjira","content":"Jya kuri **egrm.risa.gov.rw/login** hanyuma\nwandike aderesi y'imeyili n'ijambobanga wahawe."},"1189":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-7","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#kwinjira","content":"Nyuma yo kwinjira ugera ahakorerwa **eGRM**."},"1190":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-8","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Ibice bibiri ni ngombwa:"},"1191":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-9","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"**Urutonde ruri ibumoso** ruhoraho. Ibiri muri rwo ni:"},"1192":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-10","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"1193":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-11","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Icyongereza"},"1194":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-12","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Shakisha"},"1195":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-13","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Search"},"1196":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-14","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Imenyekanisha"},"1197":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-15","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Notifications"},"1198":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-16","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Ahabanza"},"1199":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-17","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Home"},"1200":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-18","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"1201":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-19","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Record Issue"},"1202":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-20","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"1203":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-21","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Open Issues"},"1204":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-22","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Iby'integuro Byanjye"},"1205":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-23","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"My Assignments"},"1206":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-24","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"**Amakarita ari hagati** ashyira ibindi byose mu matsinda hakurikijwe ubwoko\nbw'akazi — kwakira ibibazo, ibitekerezo, igenzura, imishinga, abakoresha,\nn'igenamiterere rya sisitemu. Uzashobora gufungura gusa ayo inshingano zawe\nzikwemerera."},"1207":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-25","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Izina ryawe n'imeyili biri hasi ibumoso. Kanda aho kugira ngo usohoke."},"1208":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-26","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#icyapa-nyamukuru","content":"Ibyapa by'abakozi byerekanwa mu **Kinyarwanda**, kuko ari rwo rurimi sisitemu\nishyizwemo. Ipaji y'Inyandiko ziri ku byapa itondekanya\nburi nyandiko uzahura na yo n'icyo isobanura mu Cyongereza. Niba wifuza\ngukorera mu Cyongereza, saba umuyobozi wa sisitemu guhindura ururimi kuri\nkonti yawe — bihindura gusa ibyo wowe ubona, ntibihindure ibyo abandi babona."},"1209":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-27","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Inshingano muri eGRM zerekeye **imirimo**, kandi abakozi benshi bafite nyinshi\nicyarimwe. Icyo gitandukanya abakozi babiri akenshi ni **akarere** bagenewe,\natari utubuto bashobora gukanda."},"1210":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-28","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Niba akazi kawe ari…"},"1211":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-29","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Soma"},"1212":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-30","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Kwakira ibibazo by'abaturage no kubyinjiza muri sisitemu"},"1213":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-31","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Umukozi wo ku rwego rw'ibanze"},"1214":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-32","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Gusuzuma ibibazo bishya no kubyohereza ku muntu ubikwiye"},"1215":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-33","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","content":"Umugenzuzi"},"1216":{"id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in-34","page_id":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/rw/docs/staff/signing-in#ni-izihe-nshingano-mfite","cont