y anonymous**"],[667,"**Stay anonymous**"],[61,"**Stay anonymous** is selected by default. Either way you still get a tracking\ncode, and you can still check the status yourself at any time."],[671,"**Stay anonymous** ni yo isanzwe ihiswemo. Uko byagenda kose uhabwa kode yo\ngukurikirana, kandi ushobora ubwawe kureba aho kigeze igihe icyo ari cyo cyose."],[12,"**Submit a Complaint → Start form**"],[622,"**Submit a Complaint → Start form**"],[284,"**Sync Files**"],[894,"**Sync Files**"],[325,"**Tap on the map** — use this when the person is describing somewhere else.\nTap, and drag the pin to adjust."],[596,"**The cards in the middle** group everything else by the kind of work it\nbelongs to — intake, feedback, supervision, projects, users, and system\nsettings. You will only be able to open the ones your role allows."],[318,"**The date** — when the problem happened, not today. Tap **Set for Today**\nonly if it is happening now. Tick **Current event or multiple occurrences**\nfor something ongoing."],[321,"**The description** — in the person's own words, as fully as you can. A\nreviewer who was not there has only this to work from."],[66,"**The Next button stays grey.** A required field on that step is still\nempty. On step 1 you need both a category and an issue type; on step 3 the\ndescription must be at least 10 characters."],[506,"**The region you need is not in the list.** Choose the nearest level above\nit and name the exact place in the description. Then tell your administrator\nthe region is missing."],[570,"**The same problem is reported twice.** Resolve one and record the other's\ntracking code in the outcome, so both codes give the person a real answer."],[581,"**The sidebar on the left** is always there. Its entries are:"],[94,"**The status has not changed in a long time.** Contact the office handling\nthe project and quote your tracking code."],[376,"**This Week**"],[986,"**This Week**"],[434,"**Time limits** set how long each stage may take before a complaint escalates\non its own."],[374,"**Total Issues**"],[984,"**Total Issues**"],[14,"**Track a Complaint → Enter code**"],[624,"**Track a Complaint → Enter code**"],[995,"**Type Trends** — inzira ibibazo byanyuzemo: Mobile App, In Person, Email,\nWeb Form, SMS, Phone Call."],[385,"**Type Trends** — the channel complaints arrived through: Mobile App, In\nPerson, Email, Web Form, SMS, Phone Call."],[1078,"**Uburyo cyakugezeho** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal, Written"],[930,"**Ubwoko bw'ikibazo** — Complaint, Service Issue, Question cyangwa Other."],[1091,"**Ubwoko bw'Ikibazo** bwandika inzira ikibazo cyanyuzemo, atari uburemere\nbwacyo. Niba umuntu yaraguhamagaye, hitamo **Phone Call** — si **Web Form**,\nn'ubwo uri kubyandika ku ipaji ya interineti. Iyi mibare ikoreshwa mu kumenya\ninzira abaturage bakoresha koko."],[929,"**Uko cyakugezeho** — In Person, Phone Call, SMS, Email, Verbal cyangwa\nWritten. Hitamo inzira nyir'ikibazo yanyuzemo koko, atari igikoresho uri\nkwandikiraho."],[1053,"**Umukoresha nta cyo abona nyuma yo kwinjira.** Ntaho aragenerwa gukorera.\nIyi ni yo raporo isanzwe cyane kurusha izindi."],[1118,"**Umuntu atanga ikibazo kimwe kabiri.** Kandika uko biri hanyuma uvuge kode\nyo gukurikirana ya mbere mu bisobanuro. Umugenzuzi azabihuza."],[1191,"**Urutonde ruri ibumoso** ruhoraho. Ibiri muri rwo ni:"],[286,"**View Reports**"],[896,"**View Reports**"],[1117,"**Wabitse ufite amakuru atari yo.** Fungura ikibazo ukoreshe\n**Reassign Issue** niba uwagihawe atari we ukwiye, cyangwa usabe umugenzuzi\nikindi cyose — iyo ikibazo kimaze koherezwa, bimwe mu byanzu birafungwa\nkugira ngo inyandiko ikomeze kwizerwa."],[703,"**Wabuze kode.** Niba warahaye amakuru yo kukugeraho igihe wohereza,\nibiro bishobora kugushakira ikibazo cyawe. Niba warahisemo kutamenyekana,\nnta bundi buryo bwo kuyibona — wagomba kongera gutanga ikibazo."],[678,"**Wafunze ipaji utararangiza.** Nta kintu kibikwa kugeza ukanze\n**Submit Complaint**, bityo ugomba gutangira b