rvice is not working, is late, or is unavailable"],[140,"Abakoresha & Uburenganzira"],[750,"Abakoresha & Uburenganzira"],[1039,"Abakoresha bashobora kongerwamo umwe umwe, cyangwa benshi icyarimwe bavanywe\nmuri dosiye."],[142,"Abakoresha ku Mushinga"],[752,"Abakoresha ku Mushinga"],[1187,"Abakozi bakorera mu gice gitandukanye n'urubuga rusange. Ukeneye konti,\nishyirwaho n'umuyobozi wa sisitemu."],[877,"Abakozi bo ku rwego rw'ibanze akazi kabo kenshi bagakorera kure y'ameza —\nmu nama y'abaturage, mu rugendo rwo gusura ahakorerwa, mu mudugudu udafite\nmurandasi ihamye. Porogaramu ya eGRM yo kuri telefoni ni sisitemu imwe\nn'urubuga, yagenewe telefoni, kandi ikomeza gukora n'ubwo murandasi yaba\nitariho."],[246,"About the language"],[222,"Actions"],[832,"Actions"],[437,"Activation opens the project for real complaints."],[220,"Add"],[830,"Add"],[147,"Administrative Level Types"],[757,"Administrative Level Types"],[175,"Administrative Region"],[785,"Administrative Region"],[579,"After signing in you land on the **eGRM** work area."],[31,"After you submit"],[316,"Age group, gender, occupation and education are all optional. They are used\nfor reporting on who the mechanism actually reaches, so fill them in if the\nperson is comfortable answering — and skip them if not."],[106,"Ahabanza"],[588,"Ahabanza"],[716,"Ahabanza"],[1198,"Ahabanza"],[1129,"Ahantu hatatu ku rutonde rwo ibumoso:"],[1090,"Aho ikibazo cyabereye"],[1159,"Aho ikibazo kigeze"],[176,"Aho Ikibazo Kiri"],[786,"Aho Ikibazo Kiri"],[620,"Aho ukanda"],[977,"Akabuto gafite ibara ry'ivu ntikaba kangiritse — ni intambwe iza nyuma. Kora\nukurikije urutonde."],[478,"Akarere"],[1088,"Akarere"],[174,"Akarere k'Ubuyobozi"],[784,"Akarere k'Ubuyobozi"],[939,"Akarere ni ko kagena **uwakira ikibazo**. Niba ahantu nyir'ikibazo avuga\nhatari mu turere ukorera, kandika ikibazo uko biri, wandike ahantu nyirizina\nmu bisobanuro, hanyuma ubibwire umuyobozi wa sisitemu nyuma."],[1103,"Akato"],[1102,"Akato gafite ibara kari mu nkingi ya **Imimerere** kerekana aho buri kibazo\nkigeze:"],[979,"Ako kabuto ntikaboneka iyo nta nimero yatanzwe, kandi iyo nyir'ikibazo yasabye\nko amazina ye aba ibanga — muri icyo gihe icyapa cyerekana **Confidential**\nkandi kigafunga amakuru yo kumugeraho hamwe n'amazina."],[117,"All Issues"],[727,"All Issues"],[137,"All Projects"],[747,"All Projects"],[870,"Amafoto y'urubuga rusange ari muri iyi mfashanyigisho yerekana uburyo bwo mu\n**Cyongereza**. Amafoto y'ibyapa by'abakozi yerekanwa mu **Kinyarwanda**, kuko\nari cyo konti z'abakozi muri sisitemu zerekana. Buri nyandiko iri ku byapa\nby'abakozi iranasobanurwa mu Cyongereza ku ipaji\nInyandiko ziri ku byapa."],[847,"Amagambo ari amakuru y'umushinga aho kuba inyandiko za sisitemu — amazina\ny'ibyiciro nka *Complaint*, ubwoko bw'ibibazo nka *Web Form*, n'amazina\ny'amashami — aguma mu rurimi yanditswemo igihe umushinga washyirwagaho. Ni yo\nmpamvu uzabona amagambo y'Icyongereza ku cyapa mu bindi byose kiri mu\nKinyarwanda."],[645,"Amahitamo abiri kuri iki cyapa:"],[912,"Amahitamo atatu:"],[1172,"Amakarita abiri ari ku cyapa nyamukuru areba akazi katarangiye mu buryo\nbusanzwe:"],[887,"Amakarita ane, mu bwuzuzanye uzajya uyakoreshamo:"],[182,"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"],[538,"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"],[792,"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"],[1148,"Amakuru y'Ikibazo"],[184,"Amakuru y'Umuturage"],[541,"Amakuru y'Umuturage"],[794,"Amakuru y'Umuturage"],[1151,"Amakuru y'Umuturage"],[1153,"Amakuru yo kumugeraho, niba yaratanzwe"],[1029,"Amashami ashobora guhabwa ibibazo"],[1144,"Amatabi ari hejuru atandukanya inyandiko mu bice:"],[710,"Amatabi ari ku kibazo"],[960,"Amatabi atatu ari hejuru, buri rimwe rifite umubare:"],[972,"Amatabi atatu:"],[1162,"Amateka y'ukwitwazwa, niba cyaritwajwe"],[146,"Amoko y'Inzego z'Ubuyobozi"],[756,"Amoko y'Inzego z'Ubuyobozi"],[203,"An outcome has been recorded"],[504,"An outcome has been recorded"],[885,"Andika **aderesi y'imeyili n'ijambobanga** bimwe ukoresha ku rubuga. Niba\nutarigeze winjira ahandi na hamwe, bisabe umuyobozi wa sisitemu."],[664,"Andika ibisobanuro mu magambo yawe bwite kandi ushyiremo ibintu byose byafasha\numuntu kubona ikibazo: izina ry'ahantu, itariki, nimero y'ibaruwa. Umukozi\nutigeze ajya aho byabereye ni we uzabisoma."],[1124,"Andika icyemezo cyafashwe"],[1171,"Andika icyemezo ku buryo cyumvikana ku muntu utari muri byo: icyabonetse,\nicyakozwe, n'igihe. Iyi nyandiko ni yo nyandiko y'icyemezo cyafashwe."],[1058,"Andika ikibazo"],[112,"Andika Ikibazo"],[529,"Andika Ikibazo"],[590,"Andika Ikibazo"],[722,"Andika Ikibazo"],[1139,"Andika Ikibazo"],[1200,"Andika Ikibazo"],[891,"Andika ikibazo gishya — intambwe ku yindi"],[674,"Andika iyi kode cyangwa ufate ifoto y'icyapa mbere yo gufunga ipaji. Niba\nwarahisemo kutamenyekana, iyi kode ni yo **nzira yonyine** yo kureba ikibazo\ncyawe nyuma — ntishobora kongera kuboneka cyangwa kukoherezwa ukundi."],[681,"Andika kode yawe yo gukurikirana"],[149,"Android App Versions"],[759,"Android App Versions"],[129,"Appeals"],[739,"Appeals"],[660,"Ari byo bigena ibiro bizakira ikibazo cyawe, bityo hitamo ahantu ikibazo\ncyabereye koko — atari aho utuye, niba bitandukanye."],[298,"Ask before you save"],[450,"Ask before you write"],[513,"Assign it to someone"],[200,"Assigned and being worked on"],[173,"Assigned Department"],[783,"Assigned Department"],[171,"Assigned To"],[781,"Assigned To"],[84,"Assigned to an officer who is working on it."],[501,"Assigned, being worked on"],[179,"Assignee"],[789,"Assignee"],[272,"Assigning and resolving are possible from the app too, but they are easier on\nthe website. This guide covers recording and viewing."],[121,"Assignment Records"],[731,"Assignment Records"],[288,"At the bottom are three tabs — **Dashboard**, **Notifications** and\n**Profile**. Profile shows your name, your email, the regions you cover, and\na **Change Password** link."],[212,"Awaiting the next action"],[454,"Away from a desk? The same complaint can be recorded on the\nmobile app, which works with no signal and syncs when\nyou get back into coverage."],[218,"Back"],[828,"Back"],[916,"Badashaka ko haba ikintu cyoherezwa kuri bo na gato"],[1020,"Banza ushyireho **inzego** — ibyiciro ubutegetsi bwawe bufite, urugero nk'\nIntara, Akarere, Umurenge, Akagari."],[920,"Bashaka SMS cyangwa imeyili, kandi bazatanga nimero cyangwa aderesi"],[908,"Baza mbere yo kubika"],[1060,"Baza mbere yo kwandika"],[918,"Bazagaruka kuri wowe kugira ngo bamenye amakuru — ni ryo rifite umutekano kurusha ayandi"],[436,"Be careful with **final** statuses. Marking more than one status as final —\nfor example both *Resolved* and *Closed* — makes the end state of a complaint\nambiguous, and which one a resolved complaint lands in may not be the one you\nintended. Keep exactly one final status unless you have a firm reason\notherwise, and check the result on a test complaint afterwards."],[555,"Before you assign, check two things:"],[403,"Before you hand it over"],[291,"Before you start: pick the project"],[204,"Bifunze"],[814,"Bifunze"],[198,"Birakorwa"],[499,"Birakorwa"],[808,"Birakorwa"],[1109,"Birakorwa"],[210,"Bitegereje"],[820,"Bitegereje"],[558,"Both are quicker to correct now than after the work has been handed on."],[15,"Both buttons are on the home page, and both are also in the menu along the\ntop of every page."],[1156,"Buri gikorwa cyakozwe, mu bwuzuzanye"],[992,"Buri karita inagereranya n'igihe cyabanje, kugira ngo urebe niba ibintu\nbyiyongera cyangwa bigabanuka."],[1022,"Buri kibazo cyoherezwa hakurikijwe akarere kacyo, kandi buri mukozi abona\nibibazo hakurikijwe akarere yagenewe. Niba imiterere itari yo cyangwa yuzuye,\nibibazo bizagera ku biro bitari byo kandi abakozi ntibabashe kubona akazi\nkabo. Bikosore neza mbere yo kongeramo umuntu."],[864,"Buri kibazo kinyura mu nzira imwe, uko cyaba cyaje kose:"],[969,"Buri murongo werekana uko ikibazo cyaje, kode yacyo yo gukurikirana, umurongo\nwa mbere w'ibisobanuro, uwagitanze, itariki, igihe kimaze, imimerere yacyo,\nn'akarere."],[706,"Buri n