 filed."],[410,"First define the **levels** — the tiers your administrative hierarchy has,\nsuch as Province, District, Sector, Cell."],[430,"For a bulk load, upload the file, map its columns to the fields eGRM expects,\ncheck the preview, and confirm."],[277,"Four cards, in the order you will normally use them:"],[371,"Four numbers at the top:"],[406,"From the main screen, open **Imishinga → Tangiriza Umushinga Mushya**\n(*Projects → Start New Project*). To change a project that already exists,\nopen it and choose **Edit in Wizard**."],[455,"From the sidebar, click **Andika Ikibazo** (*Record Issue*)."],[643,"Fungura **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal**\nhanyuma ukande **Submit a Complaint → Start form**, cyangwa **Submit** iri muri\nmenu yo hejuru."],[618,"Fungura **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal**."],[686,"Fungura **egrm.risa.gov.rw/grm-portal/track**,\ncyangwa ukande **Track** muri menu yo hejuru."],[1122,"Fungura ikibazo"],[874,"Fungura porogaramu"],[1048,"Genzura buri kimwe muri ibi ubwawe aho kubyiyumvisha:"],[1175,"Genzura byombi kenshi. Nta na kimwe kizakugeraho nk'ubutumwa niba utaragenewe\nicyo kibazo ku giti cyawe."],[1042,"Genzura ibyerekanwe mbere yo kwemeza kwinjiza benshi icyarimwe. Gukosora\nibyinjijwe nabi ni akazi kenshi cyane kurusha gusoma ibyerekanwe."],[1051,"Genzura ko ipaji yo gukurikirana itanga igisubizo gifatika kuri kode\ny'ikibazo cy'igerageza."],[853,"Gihabwa kode yo gukurikirana"],[852,"Giratangwa"],[195,"Gishya"],[496,"Gishya"],[805,"Gishya"],[1106,"Gishya"],[822,"Gitegereje igikorwa gikurikira"],[449,"Give the person their tracking code"],[297,"Give them the code"],[578,"Go to **egrm.risa.gov.rw/login** and enter\nthe email address and password you were given."],[236,"GRM Portal"],[846,"GRM Portal"],[954,"Gufungura ikibazo kimwe"],[1006,"Gufungura umushinga, kwinjizamo uturere twawo, kongeramo abakozi, no guhitamo uko ibibazo byoherezwa."],[955,"Guhamagara nyir'ikibazo"],[614,"Guhindura ururimi"],[631,"Guhindura ururimi bihindura inyandiko 