e page to move it to a different one."],[38,"Use it when"],[304,"Use it when"],[70,"Use your tracking code to see the current status. No account or password needed."],[416,"User types"],[1026,"User types"],[141,"Users and Permissions"],[751,"Users and Permissions"],[429,"Users can be added one at a time, or loaded in bulk from a file."],[654,"Ushaka amakuru, atari igikosorwa"],[932,"Ushobora gufatanya **ifoto**, guhitamo **ishusho** isanzweho, cyangwa gufata\n**amajwi** ukoresheje utubuto dutatu turi hepfo y'ibisobanuro. Ibifatanyijwe\nbyoherezwa igihe telefoni yongeye kubona murandasi."],[1003,"Ushobora kubona *Background sync failed* mu gihe uri ahatari murandasi. Ibyo\nbyonyine si ikibazo — nta cyo ubura. Subira aho murandasi iboneka, ufungure\n**Sync Files**, hanyuma ukande **Check for Updates**."],[1,"Using the public website"],[670,"Utanga nimero ya telefoni cyangwa imeyili, bityo bashobora kukugezaho aho bigeze n'icyemezo cyafashwe."],[712,"Utubuto"],[625,"Utwo tubuto twombi turi ku ipaji y'itangiriro, kandi turi no muri menu iri\nhejuru kuri buri paji."],[1115,"Uzabona gusa ibibazo by'uturere ugenewe."],[1066,"Uzuza ifishi:"],[148,"Verisiyo za Porogaramu ya Android"],[758,"Verisiyo za Porogaramu ya Android"],[638,"Vuga aho byabereye"],[637,"Vuga ubwoko bw'ikibazo"],[178,"Wahawe"],[788,"Wahawe"],[238,"Welcome"],[673,"Werekwa **kode yo gukurikirana** isa na `RDAP-260907-6503`."],[688,"Werekwa imimerere ikibazo kigezemo, icyiciro cyacyo, n'itariki wagitangiyeho."],[5,"What \"Mobile App\" in the menu is for"],[421,"What a complaint can be about"],[477,"What happened, in as much detail as you have"],[294,"What happened?"],[56,"What happens"],[352,"What is in it"],[522,"What is in it"],[373,"What it counts"],[415,"What it defines"],[279,"What it does"],[80,"What it means for you"],[262,"What the eGRM phone app is for, how to sign in, and what the four buttons on the home screen do."],[2,"What the public website lets you do, and how to set it to your language."],[73,"What the statuses mean"],[459,"What to put"],[516,"What you can and cannot see"],[263,"What you can do with it"],[74,"What you will and will not see"],[474,"When it reached you"],[559,"When the assigned officer has finished, the outcome is recorded against the\ncomplaint and the status moves on."],[471,"When the problem happened"],[295,"Where did it happen?"],[480,"Where the problem happened"],[10,"Where to click"],[240,"Which part do you need?"],[575,"Which role am I?"],[293,"Who is reporting?"],[1046,"Witondere imimerere ya **final**. Gushyira akamenyetso ka final ku mimerere\nirenze imwe — urugero *Resolved* na *Closed* byombi — bituma iherezo ry'ikibazo\nritumvikana, kandi aho ikibazo cyakemuwe kigwa bishobora kutaba ari ho\nwagambiriye. Gumisha imimerere imwe gusa ya final keretse ufite impamvu\nifatika, kandi ugenzure ibyavuyemo ukoresheje ikibazo cy'igerageza."],[237,"Words that are project data rather than interface text — category names like\n*Complaint*, issue types like *Web Form*, and department names — stay in the\nlanguage they were entered in when the project was set up. That is why you\nwill see English words on an otherwise Kinyarwanda screen."],[347,"Working without signal"],[54,"Write the description in your own words and include anything that would help\nsomeone find the problem: a place name, a date, a reference number. An officer\nwho has never been to the location will be reading this."],[561,"Write the outcome so that it makes sense to someone who was not involved: what\nwas found, what was done, and when. This text is the record of the decision."],[64,"Write this code down or take a photograph of the screen before you close the\npage. If you chose to stay anonymous, this code is the **only** way to check\nyour complaint later — it cannot be recovered or sent to you again."],[63,"You are shown a **tracking code** that looks like `RDAP-260907-6503`."],[78,"You are shown the current status, the category, and the date you submitted it."],[518,"You are the point where a complaint stops being a piece of text and becomes\nsomeone's assigned work. Two things depend on you: that it reaches the right\nofficer, and that what happened is written down."],[322,"You can attach a **photo**, pick an existing **image**, or record **audio**\nusing the three buttons below the description. Attachments upload when the\nphone next has signal."],[7,"You do **not** need an account, a password, or a smartphone app to report a\nproblem. Everything on this page works from any web browser."],[60,"You give a phone number or email, and you can be contacted about progress and the outcome."],[393,"You may see *Background sync failed* while you are out of coverage. That on\nits own is not a problem — nothing is lost. Get back into signal, open\n**Sync Files**, and tap **Check for Updates**."],[566,"You see complaints for the regions you are assigned to, **including the\nregions beneath them**. A supervisor assigned at province level sees the\ndistricts within it; an officer assigned to one district sees only that one."],[44,"You want information, not a correction"],[505,"You will only see complaints for the regions you are assigned to."],[20,"Your choice applies immediately and stays as you move between pages."],[58,"Your complaint is handled without any contact details. Nobody can call you for more information, and you will not be notified when it is resolved."],[597,"Your name and email are shown at the bottom-left. Click there to sign out."]],"type":"string"},"page_id":{"docs":{"1":23,"2":24,"3":25,"4":26,"5":27,"6":28,"7":29,"8":30,"9":31,"10":32,"11":33,"12":34,"13":35,"14":36,"15":37,"16":38,"17":39,"18":40,"19":41,"20":42,"21":43,"22":44,"23":45,"24":46,"25":47,"26":48,"27":49,"28":50,"29":51,"30":52,"31":53,"32":54,"33":55,"34":56,"35":57,"36":58,"37":59,"38":60,"39":61,"40":62,"41":63,"42":64,"43":65,"44":66,"45":67,"46":68,"47":69,"48":70,"49":71,"50":72,"51":73,"52":74,"53":75,"54":76,"55":77,"56":78,"57":79,"58":80,"59":